INSERT INTO `products` VALUES (1,101,'TI-HD-001','450 GSM Heavyweight Streetwear Hoodie','450-gsm-heavyweight-streetwear-hoodie','variable','published',1,'visible','Heavy drop-shoulder loopback organic cotton fleece hoodie.','Engineered for streetwear labels with 450 GSM organic loopback cotton fleece with curved architectural chest panelling and double-lined hood.',95.00,NULL,38.00,50,450,'Oversized Drop-Shoulder',25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,150,'instock',0.850,35.00,28.00,6.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-03 01:16:00','2026-10-03 01:16:51'),(2,104,'TI-VJ-002','Heritage Wool & Nappa Leather Varsity Jacket','heritage-wool-nappa-leather-varsity-jacket','simple','published',1,'visible','550 GSM Melton wool body with genuine full-grain leather sleeves.','Custom athletic heritage varsity jacket with yarn-dyed 2x2 striped ribbing and heavy matte enameled snap buttons.',165.00,NULL,68.00,30,550,'Heritage Athletic',28,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,80,'instock',1.200,40.00,30.00,8.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-03 01:16:00','2026-10-03 01:16:51'),(3,105,'TI-TS-003','280 GSM Boxy Heavyweight T-Shirt','280-gsm-boxy-heavyweight-t-shirt','customizable_apparel','published',0,'visible','Dense combed single jersey tee with high-tight 1.25 inch collar.','Drop-shoulder boxy blank engineered for high-density screen printing and embroidery.',45.00,NULL,16.50,100,280,'Boxy Oversized',20,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,300,'instock',0.300,30.00,25.00,2.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-03 01:16:00','2026-10-03 01:16:51'),(4,17394,NULL,'Custom Mexico Boxing Championship Belt – Premium Gold Award Belt','custom-mexico-boxing-championship-belt-premium-gold-award-belt','simple','published',0,'visible','This custom Mexico boxing championship belt features a premium black strap with detailed gold-tone plates, red accents, boxing glove graphics, and a bold Mexico-inspired center design. Ideal for boxing tournaments, martial arts competitions, sports events, championship ceremonies, and promotional awards. The belt can be customized with logos, event names, colors, artwork, flags, and private-label branding for bulk and OEM orders.','<h1>Custom Mexico Boxing Championship Belt – Premium Gold Award Belt</h1>\r\\nCelebrate achievement and competition with this <strong>Custom Mexico Boxing Championship Belt</strong>, designed for boxing tournaments, martial arts events, sports organizations, promotional competitions, and championship award ceremonies. Featuring a strong black strap, detailed gold-tone metal plates, red decorative accents, and a Mexico-inspired center graphic, this belt creates a professional championship appearance suitable for both presentation and display.\r\\n\r\\nThe large central plate is the main visual feature of the belt and includes a detailed crown design, decorative engraving, star accents, and a bold Mexico-themed graphic in the center. Matching side plates feature boxing glove artwork surrounded by ornamental detailing, giving the entire belt a balanced and premium look.\r\\n<h2>Premium Construction and Detailed Finish</h2>\r\\nThe belt is designed with a durable black leather-style strap combined with decorative metallic plates. The gold-tone finish provides a luxurious championship appearance, while engraved patterns and raised details enhance the visual depth of the design.\r\\n\r\\nThe wide strap helps create a traditional championship belt shape and provides sufficient space for large center and side plates. The combination of black, gold, red, and green makes the belt visually striking and suitable for high-profile sporting events.\r\\n<h2>Mexico-Inspired Championship Design</h2>\r\\nThe center artwork gives this belt a distinctive identity. Mexican flag-inspired colors, combined with boxing imagery and decorative championship elements, make it suitable for boxing clubs, promotional matches, national-themed events, and international competitions.\r\\n\r\\nThe crown detail positioned above the central graphic adds a classic championship appearance, while red star accents and ornamental patterns provide a strong visual frame around the main plate.\r\\n<h2>Boxing-Themed Side Plates</h2>\r\\nThe belt includes large decorative side plates featuring red boxing glove graphics surrounded by gold ornamental elements. These side plates complement the central design while reinforcing the boxing theme.\r\\n\r\\nAdditional branding, initials, event names, team logos, or sponsor graphics can also be incorporated into the side plates depending on customization requirements.\r\\n<h2>Customization Options</h2>\r\\nThis championship belt can be customized according to your tournament, sports organization, or private-label branding requirements. Custom options may include:\r\\n<ul>\r\\n 	<li>Custom center plate design</li>\r\\n 	<li>Club or organization logo</li>\r\\n 	<li>Event or championship name</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom country flags</li>\r\\n 	<li>Winner or division title</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom strap colors</li>\r\\n 	<li>Different plate shapes</li>\r\\n 	<li>Personalized side plate artwork</li>\r\\n 	<li>Sponsor branding</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom text and lettering</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\nThese customization options make the belt suitable for both small sporting clubs and professional event organizers.\r\\n<h2>Suitable for Multiple Events</h2>\r\\nAlthough designed primarily for boxing championships, this belt can also be customized for:\r\\n<ul>\r\\n 	<li>Kickboxing tournaments</li>\r\\n 	<li>MMA competitions</li>\r\\n 	<li>Wrestling events</li>\r\\n 	<li>Martial arts tournaments</li>\r\\n 	<li>Fitness competitions</li>\r\\n 	<li>Sports promotions</li>\r\\n 	<li>Award ceremonies</li>\r\\n 	<li>Club championships</li>\r\\n 	<li>Exhibition matches</li>\r\\n 	<li>Special achievement awards</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\nIts premium appearance also makes it suitable as a commemorative display piece or promotional championship award.\r\\n<h2>Professional Presentation Value</h2>\r\\nA championship belt represents more than just an award—it becomes part of the identity of the competition. This custom boxing belt is designed to create a memorable presentation during winner ceremonies, promotional photography, social media content, tournament announcements, and sports marketing campaigns.\r\\n\r\\nThe large gold-tone plates and contrasting black strap provide excellent visibility during photography and event presentations.\r\\n<h2>OEM &amp; Private Label Manufacturing</h2>\r\\nCustom championship belts can be manufactured for sports brands, boxing academies, tournament organizers, distributors, promotional agencies, and private-label businesses. OEM customization allows buyers to develop unique artwork, plate layouts, strap designs, logos, and branding according to their specific market or event requirements.',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Custom Mexico Boxing Championship Belt – Premium Gold Award','This custom Mexico boxing championship belt features a premium black strap with detailed gold-tone plates, red accents, boxing glove graphics, and a bold Mexico',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-03 02:30:42','2026-10-03 02:30:42'),(5,17395,NULL,'Custom International Boxing Championship Belt – Premium Gold Plated Award Belt','custom-international-boxing-championship-belt-premium-gold-plated-award-belt','simple','published',0,'visible','This premium custom boxing championship belt features a bold black strap with red edging, detailed gold-tone plates, international flag accents, and a striking boxing-inspired center design. Ideal for boxing tournaments, martial arts events, sports competitions, award ceremonies, and promotional championships. The belt can be customized with your logo, event name, colors, artwork, flags, and branding for OEM, private-label, and bulk orders.','<h1>Custom International Boxing Championship Belt – Premium Gold Plated Award Belt</h1>\r\\nMake every victory memorable with this <strong>Custom International Boxing Championship Belt</strong>, designed for boxing tournaments, martial arts competitions, promotional events, sports organizations and professional award ceremonies. Featuring a bold black strap, rich red edging and highly detailed gold-tone plates, this championship belt delivers an impressive premium appearance suitable for presenting to winners, champions and special event participants.\r\\n\r\\nThe belt features a prominent central plate decorated with boxing-inspired artwork, international flag elements, ornamental detailing and a central boxing glove emblem. Additional side plates help create a balanced championship-style presentation, while the wide strap construction gives the belt a professional appearance when displayed or presented during ceremonies.\r\\n<h2>Premium Championship Construction</h2>\r\\nThe belt is designed using a durable leather-style strap combined with detailed metallic plates. The broad black base provides an elegant contrast against the gold-tone championship elements, while the red border adds a distinctive finishing touch.\r\\n\r\\nThe center and side plates feature embossed-style detailing that enhances the overall premium look. Decorative patterns, sporting symbols and international elements make the belt suitable for global tournaments, boxing events and custom championship programs.\r\\n<h2>Professional Boxing-Inspired Design</h2>\r\\nThe large central plate creates a strong focal point and includes boxing-themed graphics surrounded by decorative details. International flag accents give the belt a global competition appearance, making it especially suitable for international boxing events, combat sports tournaments and promotional championships.\r\\n\r\\nThe symmetrical side plates complement the center section and create the traditional appearance expected from a professional championship belt.\r\\n<h2>Custom Logo &amp; Branding Options</h2>\r\\nThis championship belt can be customized according to your organization, tournament or brand requirements. Buyers can request personalized details such as:\r\\n<ul>\r\\n 	<li>Custom organization or event logo</li>\r\\n 	<li>Championship name</li>\r\\n 	<li>Winner or division title</li>\r\\n 	<li>Country flags</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom colors</li>\r\\n 	<li>Center plate artwork</li>\r\\n 	<li>Side plate graphics</li>\r\\n 	<li>Promotional branding</li>\r\\n 	<li>Sponsor logos</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom text and lettering</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\nThis makes the belt ideal for brands and sporting organizations looking for a distinctive championship award rather than a standard ready-made design.\r\\n<h2>Suitable for Multiple Sporting Events</h2>\r\\nAlthough inspired by professional boxing championships, this custom award belt can also be developed for different competitive events, including boxing, kickboxing, MMA, wrestling, martial arts tournaments, fitness competitions, promotional matches and sports award ceremonies.\r\\n\r\\nIt can also be used as a presentation piece for exhibitions, sports clubs, academies, special achievements and corporate sporting events.\r\\n<h2>Premium Presentation &amp; Display Value</h2>\r\\nWith its oversized decorative plates and detailed finishing, the belt works both as an award and as a display piece. It can be presented during winner ceremonies, promotional photography, event announcements and championship celebrations.\r\\n\r\\nThe combination of black, red and gold creates a powerful professional appearance that photographs well and helps enhance the presentation of tournaments and sporting events.\r\\n<h2>OEM &amp; Private Label Championship Belt Manufacturing</h2>\r\\nCustom championship belts can be produced for sports brands, boxing clubs, event organizers, distributors and promotional companies. OEM and private-label options allow buyers to create unique designs according to their branding requirements.\r\\n\r\\nDifferent plate designs, strap colors, graphics, text arrangements and event themes can be developed depending on order requirements.',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Custom International Boxing Championship Belt – Premium Gold','This premium custom boxing championship belt features a bold black strap with red edging, detailed gold-tone plates, international flag accents, and a striking',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-03 02:30:42','2026-10-03 02:30:42'),(6,17396,NULL,'Custom Gold Wrestling Championship Belt – Premium Black Strap Award Belt','custom-gold-wrestling-championship-belt-premium-black-strap-award-belt','simple','published',0,'visible','This custom wrestling championship belt features a bold black strap with large gold-tone plates, detailed decorative engraving, and a striking center emblem design. Ideal for wrestling events, combat sports competitions, award ceremonies, promotional matches, and championship presentations. The belt can be customized with your logo, event name, colors, side plate artwork, and private-label branding for OEM and bulk orders.','<h1>Custom Gold Wrestling Championship Belt – Premium Black Strap Award Belt</h1>\r\\nCelebrate champions in style with this <strong>Custom Gold Wrestling Championship Belt</strong>, designed for wrestling promotions, combat sports events, tournaments, award ceremonies, and professional presentation use. Featuring a wide black strap, ornate gold-tone plates, and a bold central emblem, this belt delivers a premium championship look suitable for both display and competition awards.\r\\n\r\\nThe center plate features an elaborate decorative border with detailed ornamental patterns surrounding a large black-and-gold emblem. Matching side plates continue the same luxury styling, creating a balanced and professional appearance across the full belt.\r\\n<h2>Premium Gold-Tone Plate Design</h2>\r\\nThe belt is built around large decorative metal-style plates finished in a rich gold tone. Fine engraved details, patterned edges, and reflective accents give the belt a high-end championship appearance.\r\\n\r\\nThe large center plate creates a strong focal point, while the matching side plates complete the traditional wrestling belt layout. This makes the design suitable for official championship presentations, promotional photography, and display purposes.\r\\n<h2>Strong Black Strap Construction</h2>\r\\nA wide black leather-style strap provides a bold contrast against the gold plates and enhances the overall premium appearance of the belt. The strap is shaped to support the center and side plates while maintaining the classic form associated with professional wrestling championship belts.\r\\n\r\\nIts clean black finish also allows custom logos, plate colors, and branding elements to stand out clearly.\r\\n<h2>Professional Wrestling-Inspired Style</h2>\r\\nThe oversized center plate, detailed side plates, and strong black-and-gold color combination give this championship belt a classic wrestling-inspired look. It can be used for professional wrestling promotions, independent leagues, combat sports events, themed competitions, and special achievement awards.\r\\n\r\\nThe detailed ornamental styling also makes the belt suitable for collectors, promotional campaigns, sports clubs, and presentation ceremonies.\r\\n<h2>Customization Options</h2>\r\\nThis championship belt can be customized according to your brand, event, or organization requirements. Available customization options may include:\r\\n<ul>\r\\n 	<li>Custom center logo</li>\r\\n 	<li>Championship or event name</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom side plate artwork</li>\r\\n 	<li>Brand or sponsor logos</li>\r\\n 	<li>Personalized text</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom plate colors</li>\r\\n 	<li>Strap color options</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom graphics and symbols</li>\r\\n 	<li>Division or winner titles</li>\r\\n 	<li>Private-label branding</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\nThese options allow buyers to create a unique belt that matches their tournament identity or sports brand.\r\\n<h2>Suitable for Multiple Events</h2>\r\\nThis custom championship