rkouts.',NULL,'products/boxing-gloves-16973-nuciU8qR.jpg',NULL,'2026-10-03 04:09:15','2026-10-03 04:11:57'),(47,17628,NULL,'Compression short','compression-short','simple','published',0,'visible','Custom-made <strong data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"79\">Compression Shorts</strong> designed to provide a supportive, flexible, and comfortable fit for training, workouts, running, cycling, gym sessions, and sports activities. Available in <strong data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"250\">all colors</strong> with customizable fabric, GSM, compression level, waistband, length, stitching, printing, sizing, branding, and packaging. Ideal for sportswear brands, teams, retailers, wholesalers, and private-label businesses.','<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"880\">Our <strong data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"533\">Compression Shorts</strong> are designed for athletes and activewear brands looking for a combination of comfort, stretch, support, and performance-focused construction. Made from high-stretch performance fabrics, these shorts provide a close-fitting design that allows unrestricted movement during training, workouts, running, cycling, fitness, and other sports activities.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"1206\">We specialize in <strong data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"942\">Custom Compression Shorts Manufacturing</strong>, allowing brands and businesses to create products according to their exact requirements. Fabric composition, GSM, compression level, waistband design, inseam length, stitching, color, printing, logo placement, sizing, labels, and packaging can all be customized.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1462\">The fabric can be developed with moisture-management properties and a comfortable stretch construction to support active movement. Different fabric blends and weights can be selected depending on the intended sport, climate, and performance requirements.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1639\">Our <strong data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1518\">Compression Shorts are available in all colors</strong>, including custom Pantone colors, color-block designs, sublimated graphics, printed patterns, and two-tone combinations.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1884\">Whether you are a <strong data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1806\">sportswear brand, fitness apparel company, gymwear brand, athletic team, retailer, wholesaler, importer, distributor, or private-label business</strong>, our OEM and ODM manufacturing services can be tailored to your requirements.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13vagvz\" data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1918\">Material &amp; GSM Specifications</h2>\r\\n<ul data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"2453\">\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fxpb7o\" data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"2004\"><strong data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1938\">Main Fabric:</strong> Polyester-spandex, nylon-spandex, or customized performance blend</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"l8r8z3\" data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2083\"><strong data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2030\">Fabric Composition:</strong> Commonly 70–85% polyester/nylon with 15–30% elastane</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"tve2o3\" data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2134\"><strong data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2104\">Fabric Weight:</strong> Approximately <strong data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2134\">180–280 GSM</strong></li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"eknznw\" data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2165\"><strong data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2153\">Lightweight:</strong> 180–210 GSM</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"pr9t4w\" data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2198\"><strong data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2186\">Medium Weight:</strong> 210–240 GSM</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"a80jmf\" data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2229\"><strong data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2217\">Heavyweight:</strong> 240–280 GSM</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"v8m8cd\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2268\"><strong data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2244\">Stretch:</strong> 4-way stretch available</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"jcu69a\" data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2311\"><strong data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2285\">Waistband:</strong> Elasticated or customized</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"r73vfd\" data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2349\"><strong data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2325\">Inseam:</strong> Custom length available</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fg3t8y\" data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2399\"><strong data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2366\">Stitching:</strong> Flatlock or reinforced stitching</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"mdoa9y\" data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2453\"><strong data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2410\">Fit:</strong> Compression, athletic, slim, or customized</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cb8vjr\" data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2484\">GSM / Fabric Weight Guide</h3>\r\\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2711\">\r\\n<thead data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2514\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2514\">\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2499\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fabric GSM</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2514\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2711\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2589\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2543\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2542\">180–210 GSM</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2543\" data-end=\"2589\">Lightweight, breathable performance shorts</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2651\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2608\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2607\">210–240 GSM</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2651\">Balanced everyday training construction</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2711\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2670\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2669\">240–280 GSM</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2711\" data-col-size=\"md\">Heavier, more supportive construction</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<p data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2838\"><em data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2838\">Final GSM, fabric composition, stretch, and compression level depend on the selected fabric and approved production sample.</em></p>\r\\n\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"m9j42c\" data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2866\">Available in All Colors</h2>\r\\n<p data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"3014\">Our <strong data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2929\">Custom Compression Shorts are available in all colors</strong>, making them suitable for sports teams, brands, gyms, and private-label collections.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"3016\" data-end=\"3040\">Popular options include:</p>\r\\n\r\\n<ul data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3256\">\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"16y13v3\" data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3049\">Black</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"17beovj\" data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3057\">White</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1j3z0co\" data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3064\">Navy</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"6e7ebj\" data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3077\">Royal Blue</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1o4swr\" data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3083\">Red</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"170hor7\" data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3091\">Green</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1j44p4x\" data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3098\">Grey</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1yqrw7l\" data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3109\">Charcoal</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1sorfy0\" data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3118\">Orange</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"2e13bg\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3127\">Yellow</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1tkxs7s\" data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3136\">Maroon</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"2yo8g6\" data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3145\">Purple</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"18aalwq\" data-start=\"3146\" data-end=\"3159\">Neon shades</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"r330my\" data-start=\"3160\" data-end=\"3183\">Custom Pantone colors</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1vq53rn\" data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3207\">Two-tone combinations</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1tg1zvn\" data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3236\">Custom color-block designs</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"nn7dxu\" data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3256\">Sublimated prints</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rnyyeg\" data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3282\">Customization Options</h2>\r\\n<p data-start=\"3284\" data-end=\"3335\">Create your own <strong data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3329\">Custom Compression Shorts</strong> with:</p>\r\\n\r\\n<ul data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3738\">\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1oy42pq\" data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3364\">Custom fabric composition</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1a4yxsy\" data-start=\"3365\" data-end=\"3377\">Custom GSM</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"h3ffc3\" data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3404\">Custom compression level</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"73idat\" data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3420\">Custom colors</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1aqvqwa\" data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3439\">Custom waistband</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fp4yuy\" data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3462\">Custom inseam length</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1a4ztog\" data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3475\">Custom fit</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"2jsxbe\" data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3494\">Custom stitching</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1y3av2t\" data-start=\"3495\" data-end=\"3511\">Flatlock seams</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1ttjo68\" data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3538\">Custom logo and branding</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"12v0qaw\" data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3561\">Sublimation printing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"sunjkl\" data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3579\">Screen printing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"18vkkdj\" data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3604\">Heat-transfer printing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1mmpozq\" data-start=\"3605\" data-end=\"3634\">Silicone or rubber branding</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1ft2339\" data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3666\">Custom labels and care labels</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1d1qih0\" data-start=\"3667\" data-end=\"3685\">Custom packaging</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"sbbzu6\" data-start=\"3686\" data-end=\"3715\">Private-label manufacturing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1841w98\" data-start=\"3716\" data-end=\"3738\">OEM &amp; ODM production</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1p3n13g\" data-start=\"3740\" data-end=\"3753\">Size Chart</h2>\r\\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"4192\">\r\\n<thead data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"3796\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"3796\">\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3755\" data-end=\"3762\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Size</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3762\" data-end=\"3770\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Waist</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3770\" data-end=\"3776\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Hip</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3776\" data-end=\"3785\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Inseam</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3785\" data-end=\"3796\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Outseam</th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody data-start=\"3823\" data-end=\"4192\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"3823\" data-end=\"3866\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"3823\" data-end=\"3828\" data-col-size=\"sm\">XS</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"3828\" data-end=\"3839\" data-col-size=\"sm