" data-col-size=\"sm\">17.5 in</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<p data-start=\"4269\" data-end=\"4504\"><em data-start=\"4269\" data-end=\"4504\">Measurements are approximate. Custom measurements, extended sizes, women\'s sizing, and different inseam lengths are available according to buyer requirements. Final measurements should be confirmed with an approved production sample.</em></p>\r\\n\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ma7m6t\" data-start=\"4506\" data-end=\"4521\">Key Features</h2>\r\\n<ul data-start=\"4523\" data-end=\"5038\">\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"120npg4\" data-start=\"4523\" data-end=\"4555\">Custom-made Compression Shorts</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"693tb5\" data-start=\"4556\" data-end=\"4589\">High-stretch performance fabric</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1vuwsip\" data-start=\"4590\" data-end=\"4613\">4-way stretch options</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1lxfd7\" data-start=\"4614\" data-end=\"4651\">Close-fitting athletic construction</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"axmbu9\" data-start=\"4652\" data-end=\"4674\">Multiple GSM options</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1uxco8g\" data-start=\"4675\" data-end=\"4702\">Custom compression levels</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fcmmsn\" data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4730\">Breathable fabric options</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"12kmyid\" data-start=\"4731\" data-end=\"4767\">Moisture-management fabric options</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"18m3fpw\" data-start=\"4768\" data-end=\"4798\">Flatlock stitching available</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"4a9d6g\" data-start=\"4799\" data-end=\"4830\">Comfortable elastic waistband</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"zccr7d\" data-start=\"4831\" data-end=\"4856\">Available in all colors</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"b7xq1r\" data-start=\"4857\" data-end=\"4884\">Custom lengths and sizing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1i8figq\" data-start=\"4885\" data-end=\"4915\">Custom printing and branding</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1i9xqbi\" data-start=\"4916\" data-end=\"4939\">Private-label options</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"11uxpay\" data-start=\"4940\" data-end=\"4969\">Custom labels and packaging</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"z4rmv6\" data-start=\"4970\" data-end=\"4997\">OEM and ODM manufacturing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"18vl4qu\" data-start=\"4998\" data-end=\"5038\">Suitable for wholesale and bulk orders</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vdrhtn\" data-start=\"5040\" data-end=\"5052\">Ideal For</h2>\r\\n<p data-start=\"5054\" data-end=\"5105\">Our <strong data-start=\"5058\" data-end=\"5087\">Custom Compression Shorts</strong> are suitable for:</p>\r\\n\r\\n<ul data-start=\"5107\" data-end=\"5418\">\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1if908\" data-start=\"5107\" data-end=\"5126\">Sportswear brands</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1m2hwya\" data-start=\"5127\" data-end=\"5143\">Gymwear brands</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1t6ybxe\" data-start=\"5144\" data-end=\"5171\">Fitness apparel companies</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"bqrxt3\" data-start=\"5172\" data-end=\"5188\">Running brands</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1oanslq\" data-start=\"5189\" data-end=\"5213\">Cycling apparel brands</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"yky0oc\" data-start=\"5214\" data-end=\"5230\">Athletic teams</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"w6ex00\" data-start=\"5231\" data-end=\"5249\">Training centers</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"15hx920\" data-start=\"5250\" data-end=\"5274\">Gyms and fitness clubs</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"744vgi\" data-start=\"5275\" data-end=\"5297\">Combat-sports brands</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1d31b1n\" data-start=\"5298\" data-end=\"5309\">Retailers</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1l7r4ej\" data-start=\"5310\" data-end=\"5323\">Wholesalers</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1fi8yy9\" data-start=\"5324\" data-end=\"5335\">Importers</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"hdrak4\" data-start=\"5336\" data-end=\"5350\">Distributors</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1wtoufy\" data-start=\"5351\" data-end=\"5377\">Private-label businesses</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1jysb2r\" data-start=\"5378\" data-end=\"5404\">Online sportswear stores</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1izbjte\" data-start=\"5405\" data-end=\"5418\">Bulk buyers</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12jqevt\" data-start=\"5420\" data-end=\"5462\">Custom Compression Shorts Manufacturing</h2>\r\\n<p data-start=\"5464\" data-end=\"5819\">We provide <strong data-start=\"5475\" data-end=\"5518\">Custom Compression Shorts Manufacturing</strong> for businesses looking to develop professional sportswear and activewear collections. From <strong data-start=\"5610\" data-end=\"5700\">fabric composition, GSM, stretch, compression level, color, waistband, inseam, and fit</strong> to printing, branding, labels, and packaging, the complete product can be customized according to your specifications.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"5821\" data-end=\"5986\">Our <strong data-start=\"5825\" data-end=\"5870\">OEM, ODM, and private-label manufacturing</strong> services are suitable for established sportswear brands as well as businesses launching new activewear collections.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"5988\" data-end=\"6234\">Whether you require <strong data-start=\"6008\" data-end=\"6157\">plain compression shorts, branded gym shorts, running compression shorts, cycling shorts, athletic teamwear, or custom printed compression shorts</strong>, we can manufacture according to your approved design and production sample.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"6236\" data-end=\"6500\">Combining <strong data-start=\"6246\" data-end=\"6395\">stretch performance fabric, supportive construction, comfortable fit, customizable compression, professional stitching, and personalized branding</strong>, our Custom Compression Shorts are an excellent choice for modern sportswear and activewear collections.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h2cxh1\" data-start=\"6502\" data-end=\"6518\">SEO Keywords</h3>\r\\n<p data-start=\"6520\" data-end=\"6988\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"6520\" data-end=\"6988\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Compression Shorts, Custom Compression Shorts, Custom Compression Shorts Manufacturer, Compression Shorts Manufacturer, Men\'s Compression Shorts, Women\'s Compression Shorts, Athletic Compression Shorts, Gym Compression Shorts, Sports Compression Shorts, Running Compression Shorts, Cycling Compression Shorts, Custom Sportswear, Wholesale Compression Shorts, Private Label Compression Shorts, OEM Compression Shorts, ODM Sportswear, Custom Activewear Manufacturer.</strong></p>',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Compression short','Custom-made Compression Shorts designed with stretch performance fabric for a supportive, flexible, and comfortable fit during training, running, gym workouts,',NULL,'products/compression-short-17632-4olTYI2S.jpeg',NULL,'2026-10-03 04:12:03','2026-10-03 04:12:07'),(49,17635,NULL,'Compression short','compression-short-17635','simple','published',0,'visible','Custom-made <strong data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"79\">Compression Shorts</strong> designed with high-stretch performance fabric for a supportive, flexible, and comfortable fit during workouts, running, gym training, cycling, and sports activities. Available in <strong data-start=\"259\" data-end=\"273\">all colors</strong> with customizable fabric, GSM, compression level, waistband, length, stitching, printing, sizing, branding, and packaging. Ideal for sportswear brands, teams, retailers, wholesalers, and private-label businesses.','<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\">\r\\n<div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6a8fdb3c-34f4-83e8-9f23-63058d56136f-51\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-6a8fdb3c-34f4-83e8-9f23-63058d56136f-51\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6a8fdb3c-34f4-83e8-9f23-63058d56136f-51\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-114\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-8 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\">\r\\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"ba3444fb-42a1-4f39-83b5-2b35086d05e4\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\\n<div class=\"yWcLfW_streamingContainer markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\">\r\\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"912\">Our <strong data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"556\">Compression Shorts</strong> are designed for athletes, fitness enthusiasts, sports teams, and activewear brands seeking a combination of flexibility, support, comfort, and freedom of movement. Made from high-stretch performance fabrics, these shorts provide a close-fitting construction suitable for training, gym workouts, running, cycling, fitness, and various sporting activities.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"1235\">We specialize in <strong data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"974\">Custom Compression Shorts Manufacturing</strong>, allowing you to create your own product according to your exact specifications. The <strong data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1212\">fabric composition, GSM, compression level, color, waistband, inseam length, stitching, fit, printing, logo placement, sizing, labels, and packaging</strong> can all be customized.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1481\">Performance fabric options can be selected according to the intended application, including breathable and moisture-management constructions. Different fabric weights and stretch levels are also available to suit various sportswear collections.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1667\">Our <strong data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1553\">Compression Shorts are custom-made and available in all colors</strong>, including custom Pantone shades, two-tone designs, color-block patterns, sublimated graphics, and custom prints.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1949\">Whether you are a <strong data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1871\">sportswear brand, gymwear company, fitness apparel manufacturer, athletic team, running brand, cycling brand, retailer, wholesaler, importer, distributor, or private-label business</strong>, our OEM and ODM manufacturing services can be tailored to your requirements.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13vagvz\" data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1983\">Material &amp; GSM Specifications</h2>\r\\n<ul data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2509\">\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fxpb7o\" data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2069\"><strong data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2003\">Main Fabric:</strong> Polyester-spandex, nylon-spandex, or customized performance blend</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"e9unfr\" data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2139\"><strong data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2095\">Common Composition:</strong> 70–85% polyester/nylon with 15–30% elastane</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"tve2o3\" data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2190\"><strong data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2160\">Fabric Weight:</strong> Approximately <strong data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2190\">180–280 GSM</strong></li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"eknznw\" data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2221\"><strong data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2209\">Lightweight:</strong> 180–210 GSM</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"pr9t4w\" data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2254\"><strong data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2242\">Medium Weight:</strong> 210–240 GSM</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"a80jmf\" data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2285\"><strong data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2273\">Heavyweight:</strong> 240–280 GSM</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"v8m8cd\" data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2324\"><strong data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2300\">Stretch:</strong> 4-way stretch available</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"jcu69a\" data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2367\"><strong data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2341\">Waistband:</strong> Elasticated or customized</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"r73vfd\" data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2405\"><strong data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2381\">Inseam:</strong> Custom length available</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fg3t8y\" data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2455\"><strong data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2422\">Stitching:</strong> Flatlock or reinforced stitching</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"mdoa9y\" data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2509\"><strong data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2466\">Fit:</strong> Compression, athletic, slim, or customized</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cb8vjr\" data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2540\">GSM / Fabric Weight Guide</h3>\r\\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-revers