tness clubs</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"744vgi\" data-start=\"5255\" data-end=\"5277\">Combat-sports brands</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1d31b1n\" data-start=\"5278\" data-end=\"5289\">Retailers</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1l7r4ej\" data-start=\"5290\" data-end=\"5303\">Wholesalers</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1fi8yy9\" data-start=\"5304\" data-end=\"5315\">Importers</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"hdrak4\" data-start=\"5316\" data-end=\"5330\">Distributors</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1wtoufy\" data-start=\"5331\" data-end=\"5357\">Private-label businesses</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1jysb2r\" data-start=\"5358\" data-end=\"5384\">Online sportswear stores</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1izbjte\" data-start=\"5385\" data-end=\"5398\">Bulk buyers</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12jqevt\" data-start=\"5400\" data-end=\"5442\">Custom Compression Shorts Manufacturing</h2>\r\\n<p data-start=\"5444\" data-end=\"5791\">We provide <strong data-start=\"5455\" data-end=\"5498\">Custom Compression Shorts Manufacturing</strong> for businesses developing professional sportswear and activewear collections. From <strong data-start=\"5582\" data-end=\"5672\">fabric composition, GSM, stretch, compression level, color, waistband, inseam, and fit</strong> to printing, branding, labels, and packaging, the complete product can be customized according to your specifications.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"5793\" data-end=\"5958\">Our <strong data-start=\"5797\" data-end=\"5842\">OEM, ODM, and private-label manufacturing</strong> services are suitable for established sportswear brands as well as businesses launching new activewear collections.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"5960\" data-end=\"6203\">Whether you need <strong data-start=\"5977\" data-end=\"6126\">plain compression shorts, branded gym shorts, running compression shorts, cycling shorts, athletic teamwear, or custom printed compression shorts</strong>, we can manufacture according to your approved design and production sample.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"6205\" data-end=\"6469\">Combining <strong data-start=\"6215\" data-end=\"6364\">stretch performance fabric, supportive construction, comfortable fit, customizable compression, professional stitching, and personalized branding</strong>, our Custom Compression Shorts are an excellent choice for modern sportswear and activewear collections.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h2cxh1\" data-start=\"6471\" data-end=\"6487\">SEO Keywords</h3>\r\\n<p data-start=\"6489\" data-end=\"6957\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"6489\" data-end=\"6957\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Compression Shorts, Custom Compression Shorts, Custom Compression Shorts Manufacturer, Compression Shorts Manufacturer, Men\'s Compression Shorts, Women\'s Compression Shorts, Athletic Compression Shorts, Gym Compression Shorts, Sports Compression Shorts, Running Compression Shorts, Cycling Compression Shorts, Custom Sportswear, Wholesale Compression Shorts, Private Label Compression Shorts, OEM Compression Shorts, ODM Sportswear, Custom Activewear Manufacturer.</strong></p>\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div>\r\\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\">\r\\n<div class=\"text-center\"></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\" data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\">\r\\n<div></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</section></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Compression short','Custom-made Compression Shorts designed with high-stretch performance fabric for a supportive, flexible, and comfortable fit during workouts, running, gym train',NULL,'products/compression-short-17635-xTk6g2Sz.jpeg',NULL,'2026-10-03 04:12:03','2026-10-03 04:12:08'),(50,17638,NULL,'Compression short','compression-short-17638','simple','published',0,'visible','Custom-made <strong data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"79\">Compression Shorts</strong> designed with high-stretch performance fabric for a supportive, flexible, and comfortable fit during workouts, running, gym training, cycling, and sports activities. Available in <strong data-start=\"259\" data-end=\"273\">all colors</strong> with customizable fabric, GSM, compression level, waistband, length, stitching, printing, sizing, branding, and packaging. Ideal for sportswear brands, athletic teams, retailers, wholesalers, and private-label businesses','<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\">\r\\n<div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6a8fdb3c-34f4-83e8-9f23-63058d56136f-52\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-6a8fdb3c-34f4-83e8-9f23-63058d56136f-52\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6a8fdb3c-34f4-83e8-9f23-63058d56136f-52\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-116\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-8 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\">\r\\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"ff939fbe-5743-490c-a77c-0ccd96b2f61f\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\\n<div class=\"yWcLfW_streamingContainer markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\">\r\\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"943\">Our <strong data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"565\">Compression Shorts</strong> are designed for athletes, fitness enthusiasts, sports teams, and activewear brands seeking a combination of comfort, stretch, support, and freedom of movement. Made from high-quality performance fabrics, these shorts feature a close-fitting construction that allows unrestricted movement during training, gym workouts, running, cycling, fitness, and other sporting activities.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"1269\">We specialize in <strong data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1005\">Custom Compression Shorts Manufacturing</strong>, allowing you to develop your own designs according to your exact product requirements. You can customize the <strong data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1268\">fabric composition, GSM, compression level, color, waistband, inseam length, stitching, fit, printing, logo placement, sizing, labels, and packaging</strong>.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1530\">Performance fabrics can be selected according to the intended application, with options for breathable, stretchable, and moisture-management constructions. Different fabric weights and compression levels can also be developed according to your specifications.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1716\">Our <strong data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1602\">Compression Shorts are custom-made and available in all colors</strong>, including custom Pantone shades, two-tone designs, color-block patterns, sublimated graphics, and custom prints.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1994\">Whether you are a <strong data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1916\">sportswear brand, gymwear company, fitness apparel business, athletic team, running brand, cycling brand, retailer, wholesaler, importer, distributor, or private-label business</strong>, our OEM and ODM manufacturing services can be tailored to your requirements.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13vagvz\" data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2028\">Material &amp; GSM Specifications</h2>\r\\n<ul data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2554\">\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fxpb7o\" data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2114\"><strong data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2048\">Main Fabric:</strong> Polyester-spandex, nylon-spandex, or customized performance blend</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"e9unfr\" data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2184\"><strong data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2140\">Common Composition:</strong> 70–85% polyester/nylon with 15–30% elastane</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"tve2o3\" data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2235\"><strong data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2205\">Fabric Weight:</strong> Approximately <strong data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2235\">180–280 GSM</strong></li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"eknznw\" data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2266\"><strong data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2254\">Lightweight:</strong> 180–210 GSM</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"pr9t4w\" data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2299\"><strong data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2287\">Medium Weight:</strong> 210–240 GSM</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"a80jmf\" data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2330\"><strong data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2318\">Heavyweight:</strong> 240–280 GSM</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"v8m8cd\" data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2369\"><strong data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2345\">Stretch:</strong> 4-way stretch available</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"jcu69a\" data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2412\"><strong data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2386\">Waistband:</strong> Elasticated or customized</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"r73vfd\" data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2450\"><strong data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2426\">Inseam:</strong> Custom length available</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fg3t8y\" data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2500\"><strong data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2467\">Stitching:</strong> Flatlock or reinforced stitching</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"mdoa9y\" data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2554\"><strong data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2511\">Fit:</strong> Compression, athletic, slim, or customized</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cb8vjr\" data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2585\">GSM / Fabric Weight Guide</h3>\r\\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2812\">\r\\n<thead data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2615\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2615\">\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2600\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fabric GSM</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2600\" data-end=\"2615\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Description</th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2812\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2687\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2644\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2643\">180–210 GSM</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2687\">Lightweight and breathable construction</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2749\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2706\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2705\">210–240 GSM</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2749\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Balanced everyday training construction</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2812\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2768\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2767\">240–280 GSM</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2812\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Heavier and more supportive construction</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<p data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2941\"><em data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2941\">Final GSM, fabric composition, stretch, and compression level depend on the selected material and approved production sample.</em></p>\r\\n\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"m9j42c\" data-start=\"2943\" data-end=\"2969\">Available in All Colors</h2>\r\\n<p data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3105\">Our <strong data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3032\">Custom Compression Shorts are available in all colors</strong>, allowing brands and teams to create products that match their identity.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3131\">Popular options include:</p>\r\\n\r\\n<ul data-start=\"3133\" data-end=\"3340\">\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"16y13v3\" data-start=\"3133\" data-end=\"3140\">Black</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"17beovj\" data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3148\">White</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1j3z0co\" data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3155\">Navy</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"6e7ebj\" data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3168\">Royal Blue</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1o4swr\" data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3174\">Red</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"170hor7\" data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3182\">Green</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1j44p4x\" data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3189\">Grey</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1yqrw7l\" data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3200\">Charcoal</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1sorfy0\" data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3209\">Orange</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"2e13bg\" data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3218\">Yellow</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1tkxs7s\" data-start=\"3219\" data-end=\"3227\">Maroon</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"2yo8g6\" data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3236\">Purple</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"18aalwq\" data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3250\">Neon shades</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"r330my\" data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3274\">Custom Pantone colors</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1vq53rn\" data-start=\"3275\" data-end=\"3298\">Two-tone combinations</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1bs97n4\" data-start=\"3299\" data-end=\"3320\">Color-block designs</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"nn7dxu\" data-start=\"3321\" data-end=\"3340\">Sublimated prints</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rnyyeg\" data-start=\"3342\" data-end=\"3366\">Customization Options</h2>\r\\n<p data-start=\"3368\" data-end=\"3426\">Your <strong data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3402\">Custom Compression Shorts</strong> can be customized with:</p>\r\\n\r\\n<ul data-start=\"3428\" data-end=\"3834\">\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1oy42pq\" data-start=\"3428\" data-end=\"3455\">Custom fabric composition</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1a4yxsy\" data-start=\"3456\" data-end=\"3468\">Custom GSM</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"h3ffc3\" data-start=\"3469\" data-end=\"3495\">Custom compression level</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"73idat\" data-start=\"3496\" data-end=\"3511\">Custom colors</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1aqvqwa\" data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3530\">Custom waistband</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fp4yuy\" data-start=\"3531\" data-end=\"3553\">Custom inseam length</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1a4ztog\" data-start=\"3554\" data-end=\"3566\">Custom fit</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"2jsxbe\" data-start=\"3567\" data-end=\"3585\">Custom stitching</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1y3av2t\" data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3602\">Flatlock seams</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1ttjo68\" data-start=\"3603\" data-end=\"3629\">Custom logo and branding</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"12v0qaw\" data-start=\"3630\" data-end=\"3652\">Sublimation printing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"sunjkl\" data-start=\"3653\" data-end=\"3670\">Screen printing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"18vkkdj\" data-start=\"3671\" data-end=\"3695\">Heat-transfer printing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1mmpozq\" data-start=\"3696\" data-end=\"3725\">Silicone or rubber branding</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"7peb8u\" data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"3741\">Custom labels</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"4calq3\" data-start=\"3742\" data-end=\"3762\">Custom care labels</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1d1qih0\" data-start=\"3763\" data-end=\"3781\">Custom packaging</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"sbbzu6\" data-start=\"3782\" data-end=\"3811\">Private-label manufacturing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1841w98\" data-start=\"3812\" data-end=\"3834\">OEM &amp; ODM production</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1p3n13g\" data-start=\"3836\" data-end=\"3849\">Size Chart</h2>\r\\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3851\" data-end=\"4288\">\r\\n<thead data-start=\"3851\" data-end=\"3892\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"3851\" data-end=\"3892\">\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3851\" data-end=\"3858\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Size</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3858\" data-end=\"3866\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Waist</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3872\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Hip</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3872\" data-end=\"3881\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Inseam</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3892\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Outseam</th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody data-start=\"3919\" data-end=\"4288\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"3919\" data-end=\"3962\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"3919\" data-end=\"3924\" data-col-size=\"sm\">XS</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3924\" data-end=\"3935\">26–28 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3935\" data-end=\"3946\">32–34 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"3953\">7 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3953\" data-end=\"3962\">14 in</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"3963\" data-end=\"4009\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"3963\" data-end=\"3967\" data-col-size=\"sm\">S</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"3967\" data-end=\"3978\" data-col-size=\"sm\">28–30 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3978\" data-end=\"3989\">34–36 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3989\" data-end=\"3998\">7.5 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3998\" data-end=\"4009\">14.5 in</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"4010\" data-end=\"4052\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"4010\" data-end=\"4014\" data-col-size=\"sm\">M</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4025\">30–32 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4025\" data-end=\"4036\">36–38 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4036\" data-end=\"4043\">8 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4043\" data-end=\"4052\">15 in</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"4053\" data-end=\"4099\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"4053\" data-end=\"4057\" data-col-size=\"sm\">L</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4057\" data-end=\"4068\">32–34 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4068\" data-end=\"4079\">38–40 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4079\" data-end=\"4088\">8.5 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4088\" data-end=\"4099\">15.5 in</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"4100\" data-end=\"4143\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"4100\" data-end=\"4105\" data-col-size=\"sm\">XL</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4105\" data-end=\"4116\">34–36 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4116\" data-end=\"4127\">40–42 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4127\" data-end=\"4134\">9 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4134\" data-end=\"4143\">16 in</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"4144\" data-end=\"4192\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"4144\" data-end=\"4150\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2XL</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4150\" data-end=\"4161\" data-col-size=\"sm\">36–38 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4161\" data-end=\"4172\" data-col-size=\"sm\">42–44 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4172\" data-end=\"4181\" data-col-size=\"sm\">9.5 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4192\" data-col-size=\"sm\">16.5 in</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"4193\" data-end=\"4238\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"4193\" data-end=\"4199\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3XL</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4199\" data-end=\"4210\" data-col-size=\"sm\">38–41 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4210\" data-end=\"4221\" data-col-size=\"sm\">44–47 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4221\" data-end=\"4229\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4229\" data-end=\"4238\" data-col-size=\"sm\">17 in</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"4239\" data-end=\"4288\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"4239\" data-end=\"4245\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4XL</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4245\" data-end=\"4256\">41–44 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4256\" data-end=\"4267\">47–50 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4267\" data-end=\"4277\">10.5 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4277\" data-end=\"4288\">17.5 in</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<p data-start=\"4290\" data-end=\"4525\"><em data-start=\"4290\" data-end=\"4525\">Measurements are approximate. Custom measurements, extended sizes, women\'s sizing, and different inseam lengths are available according to buyer requirements. Final measurements should be confirmed with an approved production sample.</em></p>\r\\n\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ma7m6t\" data-start=\"4527\" data-end=\"4542\">Key Features</h2>\r\\n<ul data-start=\"4544\" data-end=\"5059\">\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"120npg4\" data-start=\"4544\" data-end=\"4576\">Custom-made Compression Shorts</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"693tb5\" data-start=\"4577\" data-end=\"4610\">High-stretch performance fabric</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1vuwsip\" data-start=\"4611\" data-end=\"4634\">4-way stretch options</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1lxfd7\" data-start=\"4635\" data-end=\"4672\">Close-fitting athletic construction</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"axmbu9\" data-start=\"4673\" data-end=\"4695\">Multiple GSM options</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1uxco8g\" data-start=\"4696\" data-end=\"4723\">Custom compression levels</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fcmmsn\" data-start=\"4724\" data-end=\"4751\">Breathable fabric options</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"12kmyid\" data-start=\"4752\" data-end=\"4788\">Moisture-management fabric options</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"18m3fpw\" data-start=\"4789\" data-end=\"4819\">Flatlock stitching available</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"4a9d6g\" data-start=\"4820\" data-end=\"4851\">Comfortable elastic waistband</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"zccr7d\" data-start=\"4852\" data-end=\"4877\">Available in all colors</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"b7xq1r\" data-start=\"4878\" data-end=\"4905\">Custom lengths and sizing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1i8figq\" data-start=\"4906\" data-end=\"4936\">Custom printing and branding</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1i9xqbi\" data-start=\"4937\" data-end=\"4960\">Private-label options</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"11uxpay\" data-start=\"4961\" data-end=\"4990\">Custom labels and packaging</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"z4rmv6\" data-start=\"4991\" data-end=\"5018\">OEM and ODM manufacturing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"18vl4qu\" data-start=\"5019\" data-end=\"5059\">Suitable for wholesale and bulk orders</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vdrhtn\" data-start=\"5061\" data-end=\"5073\">Ideal For</h2>\r\\n<p data-start=\"5075\" data-end=\"5126\">Our <strong data-start=\"5079\" data-end=\"5108\">Custom Compression Shorts</strong> are suitable for:</p>\r\\n\r\\n<ul data-start=\"5128\" data-end=\"5439\">\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1if908\" data-start=\"5128\" data-end=\"5147\">Sportswear brands</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1m2hwya\" data-start=\"5148\" data-end=\"5164\">Gymwear brands</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1t6ybxe\" data-start=\"5165\" data-end=\"5192\">Fitness apparel companies</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"bqrxt3\" data-start=\"5193\" data-end=\"5209\">Running brands</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1oanslq\" data-start=\"5210\" data-end=\"5234\">Cycling apparel brands</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"yky0oc\" data-start=\"5235\" data-end=\"5251\">Athletic teams</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"w6ex00\" data-start=\"5252\" data-end=\"5270\">Training centers</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"15hx920\" data-start=\"5271\" data-end=\"5295\">Gyms and fitness clubs</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"744vgi\" data-start=\"5296\" data-end=\"5318\">Combat-sports brands</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1d31b1n\" data-start=\"5319\" data-end=\"5330\">Retailers</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1l7r4ej\" data-start=\"5331\" data-end=\"5344\">Wholesalers</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1fi8yy9\" data-start=\"5345\" data-end=\"5356\">Importers</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"hdrak4\" data-start=\"5357\" data-end=\"5371\">Distributors</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1wtoufy\" data-start=\"5372\" data-end=\"5398\">Private-label businesses</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1jysb2r\" data-start=\"5399\" data-end=\"5425\">Online sportswear stores</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1izbjte\" data-start=\"5426\" data-end=\"5439\">Bulk buyers</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ra2zna\" data-start=\"5441\" data-end=\"5464\">Custom Manufacturing</h2>\r\\n<p data-start=\"5466\" data-end=\"5821\">We provide <strong data-start=\"5477\" data-end=\"5520\">Custom Compression Shorts Manufacturing</strong> for businesses looking to develop professional sportswear and activewear collections. From <strong data-start=\"5612\" data-end=\"5702\">fabric composition, GSM, stretch, compression level, color, waistband, inseam, and fit</strong> to printing, branding, labels, and packaging, the complete product can be customized according to your specifications.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"5823\" data-end=\"5988\">Our <strong data-start=\"5827\" data-end=\"5872\">OEM, ODM, and private-label manufacturing</strong> services are suitable for established sportswear brands as well as businesses launching new activewear collections.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"5990\" data-end=\"6233\">Whether you need <strong data-start=\"6007\" data-end=\"6156\">plain compression shorts, branded gym shorts, running compression shorts, cycling shorts, athletic teamwear, or custom printed compression shorts</strong>, we can manufacture according to your approved design and production sample.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"6235\" data-end=\"6499\">Combining <strong data-start=\"6245\" data-end=\"6394\">stretch performance fabric, supportive construction, comfortable fit, customizable compression, professional stitching, and personalized branding</strong>, our Custom Compression Shorts are an excellent choice for modern sportswear and activewear collections.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h2cxh1\" data-start=\"6501\" data-end=\"6517\">SEO Keywords</h3>\r\\n<p data-start=\"6519\" data-end=\"6987\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"6519\" data-end=\"6987\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Compression Shorts, Custom Compression Shorts, Custom Compression Shorts Manufacturer, Compression Shorts Manufacturer, Men\'s Compression Shorts, Women\'s Compression Shorts, Athletic Compression Shorts, Gym Compression Shorts, Sports Compression Shorts, Running Compression Shorts, Cycling Compression Shorts, Custom Sportswear, Wholesale Compression Shorts, Private Label Compression Shorts, OEM Compression Shorts, ODM Sportswear, Custom Activewear Manufacturer.</strong></p>\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div>\r\\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\">\r\\n<div class=\"text-center\"></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\" data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\">\r\\n<div></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</section></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Compression short','Custom-made Compression Shorts designed with high-stretch performance fabric for a supportive, flexible, and comfortable fit during workouts, running, gym train',NULL,'products/compression-short-17638-LtATnKB8.jpeg','2026-10-03 06:44:26','2026-10-03 04:12:03','2026-10-03 06:44:26'),(51,17641,NULL,'Compression short','compression-short-17641','simple','published',0,'visible','Custom-made <strong data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"79\">Compression Shorts</strong> designed from high-stretch performance fabric for a supportive, flexible, and comfortable fit during workouts, running, gym training, cycling, and sports activities. <strong data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"273\">Available in all colors</strong> with customizable fabric, GSM, compression level, waistband, length, stitching, printing, sizing, branding, and packaging. Ideal for sportswear brands, teams, retailers, wholesalers, and private-label businesses.','<div class=\"relative basis-auto flex-col -mb-(--composer-ov