-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\">\r\\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"a43b916b-db83-436a-a547-db18f2dfee30\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\\n<div class=\"yWcLfW_streamingContainer markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\">\r\\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"905\">Our <strong data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"556\">Compression Shorts</strong> are designed for athletes, fitness enthusiasts, sports teams, and activewear brands looking for a combination of comfort, stretch, support, and freedom of movement. Made from quality performance fabrics, these shorts feature a close-fitting construction suitable for training, gym workouts, running, cycling, fitness, and various sports activities.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"1241\">We specialize in <strong data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"967\">Custom Compression Shorts Manufacturing</strong>, giving brands complete flexibility to create products according to their own specifications. The <strong data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1218\">fabric composition, GSM, compression level, color, waistband, inseam length, stitching, fit, printing, logo placement, sizing, labels, and packaging</strong> can all be customized.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1494\">Performance fabric options can be selected according to the intended application, including breathable, stretchable, and moisture-management fabrics. Different fabric weights and compression levels can also be developed according to your requirements.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1684\">Our <strong data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1566\">Compression Shorts are custom-made and available in all colors</strong>, including custom Pantone shades, two-tone combinations, color-block designs, sublimated graphics, and custom prints.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1963\">Whether you are a <strong data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1884\">sportswear brand, gymwear company, fitness apparel business, athletic team, running brand, cycling brand, retailer, wholesaler, importer, distributor, or private-label business</strong>, our OEM and ODM manufacturing solutions can be tailored to your requirements.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13vagvz\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1997\">Material &amp; GSM Specifications</h2>\r\\n<ul data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2523\">\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fxpb7o\" data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2083\"><strong data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2017\">Main Fabric:</strong> Polyester-spandex, nylon-spandex, or customized performance blend</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"e9unfr\" data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2153\"><strong data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2109\">Common Composition:</strong> 70–85% polyester/nylon with 15–30% elastane</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"tve2o3\" data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2204\"><strong data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2174\">Fabric Weight:</strong> Approximately <strong data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2204\">180–280 GSM</strong></li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"eknznw\" data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2235\"><strong data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2223\">Lightweight:</strong> 180–210 GSM</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"pr9t4w\" data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2268\"><strong data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2256\">Medium Weight:</strong> 210–240 GSM</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"a80jmf\" data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2299\"><strong data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2287\">Heavyweight:</strong> 240–280 GSM</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"v8m8cd\" data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2338\"><strong data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2314\">Stretch:</strong> 4-way stretch available</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"jcu69a\" data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2381\"><strong data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2355\">Waistband:</strong> Elasticated or customized</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"r73vfd\" data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2419\"><strong data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2395\">Inseam:</strong> Custom length available</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fg3t8y\" data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2469\"><strong data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2436\">Stitching:</strong> Flatlock or reinforced stitching</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"mdoa9y\" data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2523\"><strong data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2480\">Fit:</strong> Compression, athletic, slim, or customized</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cb8vjr\" data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2554\">GSM / Fabric Weight Guide</h3>\r\\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2781\">\r\\n<thead data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2584\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2584\">\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2569\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fabric GSM</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2584\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Description</th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2781\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2656\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2613\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2612\">180–210 GSM</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2656\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Lightweight and breathable construction</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2718\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2675\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2674\">210–240 GSM</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2718\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Balanced everyday training construction</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2781\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2737\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2736\">240–280 GSM</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2737\" data-end=\"2781\">Heavier and more supportive construction</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<p data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2910\"><em data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2910\">Final GSM, fabric composition, stretch, and compression level depend on the selected material and approved production sample.</em></p>\r\\n\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"m9j42c\" data-start=\"2912\" data-end=\"2938\">Available in All Colors</h2>\r\\n<p data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"3074\">Our <strong data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"3001\">Custom Compression Shorts are available in all colors</strong>, allowing brands and teams to create products that match their identity.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"3076\" data-end=\"3100\">Popular options include:</p>\r\\n\r\\n<ul data-start=\"3102\" data-end=\"3309\">\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"16y13v3\" data-start=\"3102\" data-end=\"3109\">Black</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"17beovj\" data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3117\">White</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1j3z0co\" data-start=\"3118\" data-end=\"3124\">Navy</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"6e7ebj\" data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3137\">Royal Blue</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1o4swr\" data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3143\">Red</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"170hor7\" data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3151\">Green</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1j44p4x\" data-start=\"3152\" data-end=\"3158\">Grey</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1yqrw7l\" data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3169\">Charcoal</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1sorfy0\" data-start=\"3170\" data-end=\"3178\">Orange</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"2e13bg\" data-start=\"3179\" data-end=\"3187\">Yellow</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1tkxs7s\" data-start=\"3188\" data-end=\"3196\">Maroon</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"2yo8g6\" data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3205\">Purple</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"18aalwq\" data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3219\">Neon shades</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"r330my\" data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3243\">Custom Pantone colors</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1vq53rn\" data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3267\">Two-tone combinations</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1bs97n4\" data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3289\">Color-block designs</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"nn7dxu\" data-start=\"3290\" data-end=\"3309\">Sublimated prints</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rnyyeg\" data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3335\">Customization Options</h2>\r\\n<p data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3395\">Your <strong data-start=\"3342\" data-end=\"3371\">Custom Compression Shorts</strong> can be customized with:</p>\r\\n\r\\n<ul data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3803\">\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1oy42pq\" data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3424\">Custom fabric composition</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1a4yxsy\" data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3437\">Custom GSM</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"h3ffc3\" data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3464\">Custom compression level</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"73idat\" data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3480\">Custom colors</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1aqvqwa\" data-start=\"3481\" data-end=\"3499\">Custom waistband</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fp4yuy\" data-start=\"3500\" data-end=\"3522\">Custom inseam length</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1a4ztog\" data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3535\">Custom fit</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"2jsxbe\" data-start=\"3536\" data-end=\"3554\">Custom stitching</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1y3av2t\" data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3571\">Flatlock seams</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1ttjo68\" data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3598\">Custom logo and branding</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"12v0qaw\" data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3621\">Sublimation printing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"sunjkl\" data-start=\"3622\" data-end=\"3639\">Screen printing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"18vkkdj\" data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3664\">Heat-transfer printing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1mmpozq\" data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3694\">Silicone or rubber branding</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"7peb8u\" data-start=\"3695\" data-end=\"3710\">Custom labels</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"4calq3\" data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3731\">Custom care labels</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1d1qih0\" data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3750\">Custom packaging</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"sbbzu6\" data-start=\"3751\" data-end=\"3780\">Private-label manufacturing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1841w98\" data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3803\">OEM &amp; ODM production</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1p3n13g\" data-start=\"3805\" data-end=\"3818\">Size Chart</h2>\r\\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"4257\">\r\\n<thead data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3861\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3861\">\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3827\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Size</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3827\" data-end=\"3835\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Waist</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3835\" data-end=\"3841\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Hip</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3841\" data-end=\"3850\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Inseam</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"3850\" data-end=\"3861\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Outseam</th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody data-start=\"3888\" data-end=\"4257\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"3888\" data-end=\"3931\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"3888\" data-end=\"3893\" data-col-size=\"sm\">XS</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"3904\" data-col-size=\"sm\">26–28 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3904\" data-end=\"3915\">32–34 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"3922\">7 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3922\" data-end=\"3931\">14 in</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"3932\" data-end=\"3978\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"3932\" data-end=\"3936\" data-col-size=\"sm\">S</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"3936\" data-end=\"3947\" data-col-size=\"sm\">28–30 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"3958\" data-col-size=\"sm\">34–36 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"3967\" data-col-size=\"sm\">7.5 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"3967\" data-end=\"3978\" data-col-size=\"sm\">14.5 in</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4021\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"3983\" data-col-size=\"sm\">M</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"3983\" data-end=\"3994\" data-col-size=\"sm\">30–32 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"3994\" data-end=\"4005\" data-col-size=\"sm\">36–38 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4012\">8 in</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4021\">15 in</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"4022\" data-end=\"4068\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"4022\" data-end=\"4026\" data-col-size=\"sm\">L</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4026\" data-end=\"4037\" data-col-size=\"sm\">32–34 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4037\" data-end=\"4048\" data-col-size=\"sm\">38–40 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4048\" data-end=\"4057\" data-col-size=\"sm\">8.5 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4057\" data-end=\"4068\" data-col-size=\"sm\">15.5 in</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4112\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4074\" data-col-size=\"sm\">XL</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4074\" data-end=\"4085\" data-col-size=\"sm\">34–36 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4085\" data-end=\"4096\" data-col-size=\"sm\">40–42 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4096\" data-end=\"4103\" data-col-size=\"sm\">9 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4103\" data-end=\"4112\" data-col-size=\"sm\">16 in</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"4113\" data-end=\"4161\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"4113\" data-end=\"4119\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2XL</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4119\" data-end=\"4130\" data-col-size=\"sm\">36–38 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4130\" data-end=\"4141\" data-col-size=\"sm\">42–44 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4141\" data-end=\"4150\" data-col-size=\"sm\">9.5 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4150\" data-end=\"4161\" data-col-size=\"sm\">16.5 in</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"4162\" data-end=\"4207\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"4162\" data-end=\"4168\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3XL</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4168\" data-end=\"4179\" data-col-size=\"sm\">38–41 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4179\" data-end=\"4190\" data-col-size=\"sm\">44–47 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4198\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4198\" data-end=\"4207\" data-col-size=\"sm\">17 in</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"4208\" data-end=\"4257\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"4208\" data-end=\"4214\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4XL</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4214\" data-end=\"4225\" data-col-size=\"sm\">41–44 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4225\" data-end=\"4236\" data-col-size=\"sm\">47–50 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4236\" data-end=\"4246\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10.5 in</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"4246\" data-end=\"4257\" data-col-size=\"sm\">17.5 in</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<p data-start=\"4259\" data-end=\"4494\"><em data-start=\"4259\" data-end=\"4494\">Measurements are approximate. Custom measurements, extended sizes, women\'s sizing, and different inseam lengths are available according to buyer requirements. Final measurements should be confirmed with an approved production sample.</em></p>\r\\n\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ma7m6t\" data-start=\"4496\" data-end=\"4511\">Key Features</h2>\r\\n<ul data-start=\"4513\" data-end=\"5028\">\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"120npg4\" data-start=\"4513\" data-end=\"4545\">Custom-made Compression Shorts</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"693tb5\" data-start=\"4546\" data-end=\"4579\">High-stretch performance fabric</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1vuwsip\" data-start=\"4580\" data-end=\"4603\">4-way stretch options</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1lxfd7\" data-start=\"4604\" data-end=\"4641\">Close-fitting athletic construction</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"axmbu9\" data-start=\"4642\" data-end=\"4664\">Multiple GSM options</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1uxco8g\" data-start=\"4665\" data-end=\"4692\">Custom compression levels</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fcmmsn\" data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"4720\">Breathable fabric options</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"12kmyid\" data-start=\"4721\" data-end=\"4757\">Moisture-management fabric options</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"18m3fpw\" data-start=\"4758\" data-end=\"4788\">Flatlock stitching available</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"4a9d6g\" data-start=\"4789\" data-end=\"4820\">Comfortable elastic waistband</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"zccr7d\" data-start=\"4821\" data-end=\"4846\">Available in all colors</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"b7xq1r\" data-start=\"4847\" data-end=\"4874\">Custom lengths and sizing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1i8figq\" data-start=\"4875\" data-end=\"4905\">Custom printing and branding</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1i9xqbi\" data-start=\"4906\" data-end=\"4929\">Private-label options</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"11uxpay\" data-start=\"4930\" data-end=\"4959\">Custom labels and packaging</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"z4rmv6\" data-start=\"4960\" data-end=\"4987\">OEM and ODM manufacturing</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"18vl4qu\" data-start=\"4988\" data-end=\"5028\">Suitable for wholesale and bulk orders</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vdrhtn\" data-start=\"5030\" data-end=\"5042\">Ideal For</h2>\r\\n<p data-start=\"5044\" data-end=\"5095\">Our <strong data-start=\"5048\" data-end=\"5077\">Custom Compression Shorts</strong> are suitable for:</p>\r\\n\r\\n<ul data-start=\"5097\" data-end=\"5408\">\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1if908\" data-start=\"5097\" data-end=\"5116\">Sportswear brands</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1m2hwya\" data-start=\"5117\" data-end=\"5133\">Gymwear brands</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1t6ybxe\" data-start=\"5134\" data-end=\"5161\">Fitness apparel companies</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"bqrxt3\" data-start=\"5162\" data-end=\"5178\">Running brands</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1oanslq\" data-start=\"5179\" data-end=\"5203\">Cycling apparel brands</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"yky0oc\" data-start=\"5204\" data-end=\"5220\">Athletic teams</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"w6ex00\" data-start=\"5221\" data-end=\"5239\">Training centers</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"15hx920\" data-start=\"5240\" data-end=\"5264\">Gyms and fitness clubs</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"744vgi\" data-start=\"5265\" data-end=\"5287\">Combat-sports brands</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1d31b1n\" data-start=\"5288\" data-end=\"5299\">Retailers</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1l7r4ej\" data-start=\"5300\" data-end=\"5313\">Wholesalers</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1fi8yy9\" data-start=\"5314\" data-end=\"5325\">Importers</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"hdrak4\" data-start=\"5326\" data-end=\"5340\">Distributors</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1wtoufy\" data-start=\"5341\" data-end=\"5367\">Private-label businesses</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1jysb2r\" data-start=\"5368\" data-end=\"5394\">Online sportswear stores</li>\r\\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1izbjte\" data-start=\"5395\" data-end=\"5408\">Bulk buyers</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12jqevt\" data-start=\"5410\" data-end=\"5452\">Custom Compression Shorts Manufacturing</h2>\r\\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"5454\" data-end=\"5801\">We provide <strong data-start=\"5465\" data-end=\"5508\">Custom Compression Shorts Manufacturing</strong> for businesses developing professional sportswear and activewear collections. From <strong data-start=\"5592\" data-end=\"5682\">fabric composition, GSM, stretch, compression level, color, waistband, inseam, and fit</strong> to printing, branding, labels, and packaging, the complete product can be customized according to your specifications.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"5803\" data-end=\"5968\">Our <strong data-start=\"5807\" data-end=\"5852\">OEM, ODM, and private-label manufacturing</strong> services are suitable for established sportswear brands as well as businesses launching new activewear collections.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"5970\" data-end=\"6213\">Whether you need <strong data-start=\"5987\" data-end=\"6136\">plain compression shorts, branded gym shorts, running compression shorts, cycling shorts, athletic teamwear, or custom printed compression shorts</strong>, we can manufacture according to your approved design and production sample.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"6215\" data-end=\"6479\">Combining <strong data-start=\"6225\" data-end=\"6374\">stretch performance fabric, supportive construction, comfortable fit, customizable compression, professional stitching, and personalized branding</strong>, our Custom Compression Shorts are an excellent choice for modern sportswear and activewear collections.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h2cxh1\" data-star