stant Gloves are specially designed for tasks involving exposure to elevated temperatures, sparks, and radiant heat. Constructed with durable heat-resistant materials, they help protect hands during demanding industrial operations while providing comfort, flexibility, and a secure grip.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"948\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">These gloves are suitable for welding, metal handling, foundries, fabrication, industrial workshops, and other applications where protection from heat and fire hazards is required. Performance and protection can vary by glove construction and certified temperature rating, so the appropriate specification should be selected for the intended application.</p>\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div>\r\\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\">\r\\n<div class=\"text-center\"></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\" data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\">\r\\n<div></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</section></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Heat & Fire Resistant Gloves','Heat &amp; Fire Resistant Gloves are designed to provide reliable hand protection in high-temperature working environments. They offer heat resistance, durabili',NULL,'products/heat-fire-resistant-gloves-R4GvgUXt.png',NULL,'2026-10-03 07:06:01','2026-10-03 07:07:33'),(128,17159,NULL,'Impact Mechanic Gloves','impact-mechanic-gloves','simple','published',0,'visible','Heavy-duty Impact Mechanic Gloves designed for enhanced hand protection, secure grip, flexibility, and comfort during automotive repair, mechanical work, maintenance, and industrial applications.','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Impact Mechanic Gloves</strong> are designed for mechanics, technicians, and industrial workers who require enhanced hand protection during demanding repair and maintenance tasks. Featuring reinforced construction and impact-protection zones, these gloves help provide added protection against knocks, bumps, and mechanical hazards while maintaining comfortable hand movement.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The ergonomic design supports natural finger movement and precise handling of tools, components, and equipment. Reinforced palms and fingers enhance durability, while textured or coated surfaces provide reliable grip and control during workshop tasks.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for <strong>automotive workshops, mechanics, garages, motorcycle service centers, industrial maintenance teams, construction businesses, machinery industries, retailers, wholesalers, and private-label brands</strong>, Impact Mechanic Gloves can be customized according to buyer requirements, including materials, impact protection, colors, sizes, padding, coatings, packaging, and branding.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\\n\r\\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\\n 	<li>Impact-resistant protective zones</li>\r\\n 	<li>Durable and flexible construction</li>\r\\n 	<li>Reinforced palm and finger areas</li>\r\\n 	<li>Secure grip and tool control</li>\r\\n 	<li>Comfortable ergonomic fit</li>\r\\n 	<li>Excellent finger dexterity</li>\r\\n 	<li>Suitable for automotive and mechanical work</li>\r\\n 	<li>Ideal for maintenance and workshop applications</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom sizes, colors, and designs available</li>\r\\n 	<li>Private-label and bulk manufacturing options</li>\r\\n</ul>',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Impact Mechanic Gloves','Heavy-duty Impact Mechanic Gloves designed for enhanced hand protection, secure grip, flexibility, and comfort during automotive repair, mechanical work, mainte',NULL,'products/impact-mechanic-gloves-RJFyLUMQ.png',NULL,'2026-10-03 07:06:01','2026-10-03 07:07:35'),(129,17160,NULL,'Oil Resistant Mechanic Gloves','oil-resistant-mechanic-gloves','simple','published',0,'visible','Durable Oil Resistant Mechanic Gloves designed for reliable hand protection, secure grip, flexibility, and comfort when working with oils, lubricants, automotive fluids, tools, and machinery.','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Oil Resistant Mechanic Gloves</strong> are designed for mechanics, technicians, and industrial professionals who work with oils, lubricants, grease, and automotive fluids. Made with durable oil-resistant materials, these gloves help provide a protective barrier while maintaining flexibility, dexterity, and comfortable handling.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The textured or coated palm provides enhanced grip when handling oily tools, components, and equipment, while reinforced areas help improve durability during demanding workshop tasks. The ergonomic construction allows natural finger movement for precise mechanical work.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for <strong>automotive workshops, garages, mechanics, motorcycle service centers, machinery industries, maintenance teams, oil and gas operations, retailers, wholesalers, and private-label brands</strong>, these gloves can be customized according to buyer requirements, including materials, coatings, colors, sizes, padding, packaging, and branding.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\\n\r\\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\\n 	<li>Oil-resistant protective construction</li>\r\\n 	<li>Durable and flexible materials</li>\r\\n 	<li>Enhanced grip in oily conditions</li>\r\\n 	<li>Reinforced palm and finger areas</li>\r\\n 	<li>Comfortable ergonomic fit</li>\r\\n 	<li>Excellent finger dexterity</li>\r\\n 	<li>Suitable for automotive and mechanical wo