ax-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\">\r\\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"7569a351-6013-4d4b-9954-ad42e279c758\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\">\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cynqsy\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"21\">Short Description</h3>\r\\n<p data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"259\">Oil Grip Impact Gloves are durable protective gloves designed to provide impact protection and a secure grip in oily and demanding work environments. Ideal for oil &amp; gas, automotive, mechanical, construction, and industrial applications.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xbtya2\" data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"281\">Long Description</h3>\r\\n<p data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"645\">Oil Grip Impact Gloves are specially designed for tasks where workers need both impact protection and reliable grip in oily or slippery conditions. Reinforced impact-protection zones help protect the hands from knocks and mechanical hazards, while the specialized palm and finger coating helps maintain a secure grip when handling tools, equipment, and materials.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"1051\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">These gloves are suitable for oil &amp; gas operations, automotive work, mechanical maintenance, construction, machinery handling, material handling, and other industrial applications. Their durable construction provides a balance of protection, grip, comfort, and flexibility for demanding working conditions. Performance against oil and impacts varies by glove material, coating, design, and certification.</p>\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div>\r\\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\">\r\\n<div class=\"text-center\"></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\" data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\">\r\\n<div></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</section></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\\n<div class=\"mt-auto grid\">\r\\n<div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1\">\r\\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom) R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars min-h-(--gutter-remaining-height,0px) group-data-stream-active/scroll-root:h-[calc(var(--thread-response-height)-16*var(--spacing))]\"></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"sticky bottom-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px) col-start-1 row-start-1 self-end\">\r\\n<div class=\"\" data-testid=\"thread-disclaimer\">\r\\n<div class=\"min-h-9 pt-2 text-center text-xs text-token-text-tertiary [view-transition-name:var(--vt-disclaimer)] pb-4 relative overflow-hidden @w-sm/main:px-[60px]\">\r\\n<div class=\"text-base mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:4