to reduce electrostatic discharge, protect sensitive components, and provide comfortable, flexible handling for electronics, assembly, laboratory, and industrial applications.','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Anti-Static Gloves</strong> are designed for professionals working with sensitive electronic components and equipment where controlling static electricity is important. Made with specialized conductive or dissipative materials, these gloves help reduce the buildup and transfer of static charge during handling and assembly tasks.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The lightweight and flexible construction provides excellent finger dexterity and tactile sensitivity, allowing precise handling of small components, tools, and equipment. Their comfortable ergonomic fit makes them suitable for extended use in controlled work environments.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for <strong>electronics manufacturing, semiconductor facilities, laboratories, computer assembly, electrical workshops, cleanroom environments, telecommunications, industrial assembly, retailers, wholesalers, and private-label brands</strong>, Anti-Static Gloves can be customized according to buyer requirements, including materials, sizes, colors, coatings, cuffs, packaging, and branding.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\\n\r\\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\\n 	<li>Anti-static and ESD-focused construction</li>\r\\n 	<li>Helps reduce static charge buildup</li>\r\\n 	<li>Lightweight and flexible design</li>\r\\n 	<li>Excellent finger dexterity</li>\r\\n 	<li>Good tactile sensitivity</li>\r\\n 	<li>Comfortable ergonomic fit</li>\r\\n 	<li>Suitable for electronics handling and assembly</li>\r\\n 	<li>Ideal for sensitive component protection</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom sizes, materials, and designs available</li>\r\\n 	<li>Private-label and bulk manufacturing options</li>\r\\n</ul>',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Anti-Static Gloves','High-quality Anti-Static Gloves designed to reduce electrostatic discharge, protect sensitive components, and provide comfortable, flexible handling for electro',NULL,'products/anti-static-gloves-CnXKIU7E.png',NULL,'2026-10-03 07:06:01','2026-10-03 07:08:07'),(153,17214,NULL,'Heavy Impact Gloves','heavy-impact-gloves','simple','published',0,'visible','Heavy Impact Gloves are rugged protective gloves designed to help protect hands from heavy impacts, knocks, and mechanical hazards. Ideal for construction, oil &amp; gas, industrial work, machinery operation, and heavy-duty applications','<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"580\">Heavy Impact Gloves are engineered for demanding work environments where hands may be exposed to significant impacts, knocks, and mechanical hazards. Reinforced impact-protection zones help absorb and disperse impact forces while the durable construction provides abrasion resistance and a secure grip.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"950\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Suitable for construction, oil &amp; gas, automotive, machinery operation, material handling, maintenance, and other heavy-duty industrial applications. Designed for durability and comfort, these gloves provide practical hand protection while maintaining flexibility and dexterity. Impact protection performance depends on the glove\'s materials, design, and certification.</p>',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Heavy Impact Gloves','Heavy Impact Gloves are rugged protective gloves designed to help protect hands from heavy impacts, knocks, and mechanical hazards. Ideal for construction, oil',NULL,'products/heavy-impact-gloves-67xTrsJb.png',NULL,'2026-10-03 07:06:01','2026-10-03 07:08:08'),(154,17215,NULL,'ESD Gloves','esd-gloves','simple','published',0,'visible','High-quality ESD Gloves designed to help control electrostatic discharge, protect sensitive electronic components, and provide comfortable, precise handling in electronics and industrial environments.','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>ESD Gloves</strong> are specially designed for professionals working with sensitive electronic components where electrostatic discharge control is essential. Constructed from conductive or dissipative materials, these gloves help reduce static charge buildup and minimize the risk of electrostatic discharge during handling, assembly, inspection, and maintenance.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The lightweight and flexible construction provides excellent dexterity and tactile sensitivity, allowing workers to handle small components, circuit boards, tools, and precision equipment with greater control. The comfortable ergonomic fit also makes them suitable for extended use in controlled environments.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for <strong>electronics manufacturing, semiconductor facilities, PCB assembly, laboratories, computer hardware production, telecommunications, cleanroom environments, electrical workshops, retailers, wholesalers, and private-label brands</strong>, ESD Gloves can be customized according to buyer requirements, including materials, sizes, colors, coatings, cuffs, packaging, and branding.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\\n\r\\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\\n 	<li>ESD and static-control construction</li>\r\\n 	<li>Helps reduce electrostatic charge buildup</li>\r\\n 	<li>Lightweight and flexible design</li>\r\\n 	<li>Excellent finger dexterity</li>\r\\n 	<li>High tactile sensitivity</li>\r\\n 	<li>Comfortable ergonomic fit</li>\r\\n 	<li>Suitable for electronics assembly and inspection</li>\r\\n 	<li>Ideal for sensitive component handling</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom sizes, materials, and designs available</li>\r\\n 	<li>Private-label and bulk manufacturing options</li>\r\\n</ul>',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'ESD Gloves','High-quality ESD Gloves designed to help control electrostatic discharge, protect sensitive electronic components, and provide comfortable, precise handling in',NULL,'products/esd-gloves-cljnZ8fw.png',NULL,'2026-10-03 07:06:01','2026-10-03 07:08:10'),(155,17216,NULL,'Oil Grip Impact Gloves','oil-grip-impact-gloves','simple','published',0,'visible','Oil Grip Impact Gloves are durable protective gloves designed to provide impact protection and a secure grip in oily and demanding work environments. Ideal for oil &amp; gas, automotive, mechanical, construction, and industrial applications.','<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"645\">Oil Grip Impact Gloves are specially designed for tasks where workers need both impact protection and reliable grip in oily or slippery conditions. Reinforced impact-protection zones help protect the hands from knocks and mechanical hazards, while the specialized palm and finger coating helps maintain a secure grip when handling tools, equipment, and materials.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"1051\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">These gloves are suitable for oil &amp; gas operations, automotive work, mechanical maintenance, construction, machinery handling, material handling, and other industrial applications. Their durable construction provides a balance of protection, grip, comfort, and flexibility for demanding working conditions. Performance against oil and impacts varies by glove material, coating, design, and certification.</p>',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Oil Grip Impact Gloves','Oil Grip Impact Gloves are durable protective gloves designed to provide impact protection and a secure grip in oily and demanding work environments. Ideal for',NULL,'products/oil-grip-impact-gloves-cTUELFeW.png',NULL,'2026-10-03 07:06:01','2026-10-03 07:08:11'),(156,17217,NULL,'Gardening & Agriculture Gloves',