trical contractors, power distribution teams, maintenance professionals, industrial facilities, retailers, wholesalers, and private-label brands</strong>, Electrical Insulating Gloves can be supplied in different sizes, lengths, voltage classes, packaging formats, and branding options.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\\n\r\\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\\n 	<li>Electrically insulating construction</li>\r\\n 	<li>Available in multiple voltage classes</li>\r\\n 	<li>Flexible design for comfortable hand movement</li>\r\\n 	<li>Suitable for electrical and utility applications</li>\r\\n 	<li>Extended cuff for wrist and forearm coverage</li>\r\\n 	<li>Designed for professional electrical work</li>\r\\n 	<li>Available in different sizes and specifications</li>\r\\n 	<li>Inspection and testing requirements supported</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom branding and private-label options</li>\r\\n 	<li>Suitable for wholesale and bulk orders</li>\r\\n</ul>',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Electrical Insulating Gloves','High-quality Electrical Insulating Gloves designed to provide electrical insulation, dependable hand protection, flexibility, and comfortable handling for quali',NULL,'products/electrical-insulating-gloves-gdwV7aQC.png',NULL,'2026-10-03 07:06:01','2026-10-03 07:08:18'),(160,17221,NULL,'Thorn Resistant Gloves','thorn-resistant-gloves','simple','published',0,'visible','Thorn Resistant Gloves are durable protective gloves designed to help protect hands from thorns, prickly plants, scratches, and abrasion during gardening and outdoor work. Ideal for pruning, landscaping, rose handling, farming, and nursery applications.','<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-ma