oatings, insulation specifications, packaging, and branding.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\\n\r\\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\\n 	<li>Durable and flexible construction</li>\r\\n 	<li>Comfortable ergonomic fit</li>\r\\n 	<li>Enhanced grip and tool handling</li>\r\\n 	<li>Excellent finger dexterity</li>\r\\n 	<li>Reinforced palm options</li>\r\\n 	<li>Suitable for electrical installation and maintenance</li>\r\\n 	<li>Insulating options available for qualified electrical applications</li>\r\\n 	<li>Multiple sizes and materials available</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom branding and private-label options</li>\r\\n 	<li>Suitable for wholesale and bulk orders</li>\r\\n</ul>',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Electrician Gloves','Durable Electrician Gloves designed for comfortable hand protection, grip, flexibility, and dexterity during electrical installation, maintenance, wiring, repai',NULL,'products/electrician-gloves-W4rrrfUt.png',NULL,'2026-10-03 07:06:01','2026-10-03 07:08:21'),(162,17223,NULL,'Agriculture Gloves','agriculture-gloves','simple','published',0,'visible','Agriculture Gloves are durable and comfortable protective gloves designed for farming, planting, harvesting, gardening, and general agricultural work. They provide reliable protection against dirt, abrasion, and everyday hand hazards while offering a secure grip.','<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"600\">Agriculture Gloves are designed to provide dependable hand protection during demanding farming and outdoor activities. Made with durable and flexible materials, they help protect hands from dirt, abrasion, rough surfaces, and minor workplace hazards while maintaining good dexterity and grip.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"913\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Ideal for planting, harvesting, pruning, landscaping, nursery work, crop handling, livestock-rela