p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for <strong>electricians, utility companies, electrical contractors, power distribution teams, industrial maintenance professionals, construction companies, retailers, wholesalers, and private-label brands</strong>, Voltage Resistant Gloves can be supplied in different voltage classes, sizes, lengths, packaging formats, and branding options.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\\n\r\\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\\n 	<li>Electrically insulating construction</li>\r\\n 	<li>Multiple voltage classes available</li>\r\\n 	<li>Flexible and comfortable design</li>\r\\n 	<li>Extended cuff for additional coverage</li>\r\\n 	<li>Designed for qualified electrical work</li>\r\\n 	<li>Suitable for utility and industrial applications</li>\r\\n 	<li>Available in multiple sizes and specifications</li>\r\\n 	<li>Inspection and electrical testing requirements supported</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom branding and private-label options</li>\r\\n 	<li>Suitable for wholesale and bulk orders</li>\r\\n</ul>',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Voltage Resistant Gloves','High-quality Voltage Resistant Gloves designed to provide electrical insulation, dependable hand protection, flexibility, and comfortable handling for qualified',NULL,'products/voltage-resistant-gloves-WM544fId.png',NULL,'2026-10-03 07:06:01','2026-10-03 07:08:24'),(164,17225,NULL,'Farming Gloves','farming-gloves','simple','published',0,'visible','<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"275\">Farming Gloves are durable and comfortable work gloves designed for planting, harvesting, crop handling, landscaping, and general farm work. They provide reliable protection against dirt, abrasion, and everyday hand hazards while offering a secure grip.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xbtya2\" data-start=\"277\" data-end=\"297\">Long Description</h3>','<div class=\"relative basis-auto