p-1 empty:hidden\">\r\\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\">\r\\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"607\">Farming Gloves are designed to provide dependable hand protection during a wide range of agricultural and outdoor tasks. Made from durable, flexible materials, they help protect hands from dirt, abrasion, rough surfaces, and minor workplace hazards while allowing comfortable hand movement and good dexterity.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"884\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Ideal for planting, harvesting, pruning, crop handling, nursery work, landscaping, livestock-related tasks, and general farm maintenance. Their practical design provides comfort, durability, and a reliable grip for farmers and agricultural workers during everyday operations.</p>\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\" data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\">\r\\n<div></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</section></div>\r\\n<div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"f14be620-7f9a-4072-a9ec-97fc0cc5ac98\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-(--sticky-padding-top)\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"f14be620-7f9a-4072-a9ec-97fc0cc5ac98\" data-turn-id-container=\"f14be620-7f9a-4072-a9ec-97fc0cc5ac98\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-65\" data-turn=\"user\">\r\\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pt-12 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(v