p-4 grow\">\r\\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"f11dad6d-c89e-4287-8fd0-6c4532494374\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6-mini\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\">\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cynqsy\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"21\">Short Description</h3>\r\\n<p data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"251\">Livestock Handling Gloves are durable protective gloves designed for farming, animal handling, and agricultural work. They provide reliable hand protection, grip, flexibility, and comfort during demanding livestock-related tasks.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xbtya2\" data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"273\">Long Description</h3>\r\\n<p data-start=\"274\" data-end=\"571\">Livestock Handling Gloves are designed to provide dependable hand protection during routine farm and animal-handling activities. Made with durable materials, they help protect hands from abrasion, dirt, rough surfaces, and everyday handling hazards while maintaining flexibility and a secure grip.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"844\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Ideal for handling cattle, horses, sheep, goats, poultry, and other farm animals, as well as feeding, cleaning, grooming, fencing, and general agricultural work. Their practical construction provides comfort and durability for extended use in demanding farm environments.</p>\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div>\r\\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\">\r\\n<div class=\"text-center\"></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div clas