pected, tested, and used according to applicable safety requirements.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Available in multiple voltage classes, these gloves can be selected according to the electrical exposure of the application. OSHA recognizes rubber insulating glove classes from <strong>Class 00 through Class 4</strong>, with maximum AC use voltages ranging from 500 V to 36,000 V.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The flexible construction supports comfortable hand movement, while extended cuffs provide additional wrist and forearm coverage. For many professional applications, leather protector gloves are used over insulating gloves to help protect them from cuts, punctures, and other physical damage.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for <strong>electricians, utility companies, electrical contractors, power distribution teams, industrial maintenance professionals, construction companies, retailers, wholesalers, and private-label brands</strong>, Rubber Insulating Gloves can be supplied in different voltage classes, sizes, lengths, packaging formats, and branding options.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\\n\r\\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\\n 	<li>Electrically insulating rubber construction</li>\r\\n 	<li>Multiple voltage classes available</li>\r\\n 	<li>Flexible and comfortable design</li>\r\\n 	<li>Extended cuff for additional coverage</li>\r\\n 	<li>Designed for qualified electrical work</li>\r\\n 	<li>Suitable for utility and industrial applications</li>\r\\n 	<li>Available in multiple sizes and specifications</li>\r\\n 	<li>Inspection and electrical testing requirements supported</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom branding and private-label options</li>\r\\n 	<li>Suitable for wholesale and bulk orders</li>\r\\n</ul>',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Rubber Insulating Gloves','High-quality Rubber Insulating Gloves designed to provide electrical insulation, dependable hand protection, flexibility, and comfortable handling for qualified',NULL,'products/rubber-insulating-gloves-zk7IImEK.png',NULL,'2026-10-03 07:06:01','2026-10-03 07:08:26'),(166,17227,NULL,'Pesticide Resistant Gloves','pesticide-resistant-gloves','simple','published',0,'visible','Pesticide Resistant Gloves are protective gloves designed to help reduce hand exposure to pesticides and agricultural chemicals. Ideal for crop spraying, farming, gardening, chemical handling, and agricultural applications.','<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\">\r\\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"f86c12b0-4a54-4d15-9dc0-b23671122ed8\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6-mini\">\r\\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\">\r\\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"268\" data-end=\"577\">Pesticide Resistant Gloves are designed to provide a protective barrier between the hands and certain pesticides, agricultural chemicals, and other potentially hazardous substances. Made from chemical-resistant materials, they help reduce skin contact during spraying, mixing, application, and handling tasks.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"954\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">These gloves are suitable for agricultural workers, farmers, gardeners, greenhouse operations, crop spraying, and chemical-handling applications. Protection depends on the glove material, thickness, chemical formulation, concentration, and contact time, so the glove must be selected according to the pesticide label and the manufacturer\'s chemical-resistance specifications.</p>\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\" data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\">\r\\n<div></div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pesticide Resistant Gloves','Pesticide Resistant Gloves are protective gloves designed to help reduce hand exposure to pesticides and agricultural chemicals. Ideal for crop spraying, farmin',NULL,'products/pesticide-resistant-gloves-qEM5Ilsf.png',NULL,'2026-10-03 07:06:01','2026-10-03 07:08:28'),(167,17228,NULL,'Pruning Gloves','pruning-gloves','simple','published',0,'visible','<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"244\">Pruning Gloves are durable protective gloves designed for pruning, trimming, gardening, and handling plants. They help protect hands from thorns, scratches, dirt, and abrasion while providing flexibility and a secure grip.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xbtya2\" data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"266\">Long Description</h3>','<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*