le safety requirements.',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Cut Resistant Food Gloves','Short Description: \\nCut Resistant Food Gloves are protective gloves designed to help reduce the risk of hand injuries from sharp tools during food preparation,',NULL,'products/cut-resistant-food-gloves-vbnl3Nl6.png',NULL,'2026-10-03 07:06:02','2026-10-03 07:09:07'),(197,17288,NULL,'Heat Resistant Kitchen Gloves','heat-resistant-kitchen-gloves','simple','published',0,'visible','Heat Resistant Kitchen Gloves are durable protective gloves designed to help protect hands from heat during cooking, baking, grilling, oven use, and other high-temperature kitchen tasks. They provide comfortable hand coverage, flexibility, and a secure grip.','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\r\\nHeat Resistant Kitchen Gloves are designed to provide reliable hand protection when handling hot cookware, baking trays, oven dishes, grills, and other heated kitchen equipment. They are typically manufactured using heat-resistant materials that help reduce exposure to high temperatures while maintaining comfortable hand movement and handling control.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Their flexible construction allows easier gripping and handling of cookware, while textured or reinforced surfaces can provide improved grip when working with hot and slippery items. Depending on the design and material, some gloves may also offer resistance to steam, moisture, abrasion, or brief contact with hot surfaces.</p>\r\\nThese gloves are suitable for home kitchens, restaurants, bakeries, catering services, commercial kitchens, BBQ and grilling, baking, and food-processing applications. Heat-resistance performance varies by product, so gloves should always be used within their specified temperature and application limits.',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Heat Resistant Kitchen Gloves','Heat Resistant Kitchen Gloves are durab