n elegant traditional-inspired garment designed to combine classic European Trachten styling with refined decorative detailing. Featuring a fitted silhouette, deep navy blue fabric, intricate floral embroidery, contrasting dark trim, and a distinctive decorative front closure, this bodice is suitable for traditional clothing collections, cultural events, festivals, folk celebrations, themed apparel, and private-label fashion brands.\r\\n<h3>Traditional Floral Design</h3>\r\\nThis Trachten bodice features a <strong>deep navy blue base fabric decorated with elegant silver and light blue floral and botanical embroidery</strong>. The detailed ornamental pattern runs vertically along the front panels and continues around the side sections, creating a balanced and sophisticated appearance.\r\\n\r\\nThe embroidered floral arrangement gives the bodice a distinctive traditional character while providing an attractive decorative finish. The embroidery pattern, thread colors, placement, and density can be customized according to the requirements of different collections and brands.\r\\n\r\\nThe structured front panels create a clean silhouette, while the fitted waist and slightly flared lower section provide a flattering traditional shape.\r\\n<h3>Decorative Front Closure</h3>\r\\nA key feature of this bodice is the <strong>contrasting dark center trim with a decorative metal front ornament</strong>. The closure creates a strong focal point while complementing the navy fabric and floral embroidery.\r\\n\r\\nThe front fastening can be customized with different <strong>zippers, hooks, buttons, clasps, decorative ornaments, or traditional fastening systems</strong>. Buyers can also select different finishes, shapes, colors, and materials to match their collection.\r\\n<h3>Structured and Comfortable Construction</h3>\r\\nThe bodice is developed using a <strong>structured multi-panel construction</strong> designed to provide a defined and fitted appearance. The panel arrangement allows the garment to be graded across different sizes while maintaining the intended shape and proportions.\r\\n\r\\nA smooth inner lining is incorporated for a cleaner internal finish and comfortable wear. Fabric weight, lining, interlining, seam construction, and reinforcement can be adjusted according to the required quality level and end use.\r\\n<h3>Custom Fabric, Color and Embroidery</h3>\r\\nThis <strong>Trachten Bodice</strong> can be manufactured using different fabrics, textures, weights, and finishes according to the buyer\'s requirements. The navy blue color shown can be replaced with shades such as <strong>burgundy, forest green, black, cream, brown, mustard, grey, or custom Pantone colors</strong>.\r\\n\r\\nThe floral embroidery can also be completely customized. Buyers can provide their own artwork, motifs, logos, reference images, or embroidery specifications to create an exclusive design for their brand.\r\\n<h3>OEM and Private Label Manufacturing</h3>\r\\nFor brands, retailers, wholesalers, and fashion businesses, the bodice is available for <strong>OEM, ODM, and private-label manufacturing</strong>. Customers can provide a tech pack, reference sample, sketches, measurements, artwork, or design concept for development according to their specifications.\r\\n\r\\nCustomization can include:\r\\n<ul>\r\\n 	<li>Custom fabric and GSM</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom colors</li>\r\\n 	<li>Floral embroidery</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom embroidery artwork</li>\r\\n 	<li>Decorative trims</li>\r\\n 	<li>Piping and edging</li>\r\\n 	<li>Front closure styles</li>\r\\n 	<li>Decorative metal accessories</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom lining</li>\r\\n 	<li>Size grading</li>\r\\n 	<li>Pattern development</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom labels and branding</li>\r\\n 	<li>Hangtags and care labels</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom packaging</li>\r\\n 	<li>Wholesale production quantities</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h3>Suitable for Traditional and Fashion Collections</h3>\r\\nThe <strong>Embroidered Trachten Bodice</strong> can be paired with traditional skirts, dresses, blouses, or coordinated garments to create complete Trachten-inspired outfits. Its decorative embroidery and structured silhouette make it suitable for both traditional collections and contemporary interpretations of European folk fashion.\r\\n\r\\nIt is suitable for <strong>Trachten brands, traditional clothing retailers, fashion wholesalers, festival apparel suppliers, cultural eventwear collections, costume suppliers, and private-label fashion brands</strong>.\r\\n<h3>Quality-Focused Production</h3>\r\\nProduction can be carried out according to approved specifications, covering fabric selection, pattern development, embroidery, cutting, stitching, finishing, pressing, inspection, and packaging. Particular attention can be given to <strong>embroidery placement, front panel alignment, decorative closure positioning, seam quality, garment measurements, and overall finishing</strong>.\r\\n\r\\nPre-production samples can be developed so buyers can review the <strong>fit, fabric, embroidery, colors, trims, closure details, construction, and finishing</strong> before bulk production begins.\r\\n<h3>Custom Trachten Bodice for Wholesale Buyers</h3>\r\\nWhether you require a traditional embroidered bodice for an established collection or want to develop a completely customized design for your own brand, this <strong>Trachten Bodice</strong> provides a flexible foundation for custom apparel manufacturing. With customizable fabrics, colors, embroidery, trims, closures, sizing, and branding, the garment can be developed according to specific market and brand requirements.\r\\n\r\\n<strong>Contact us for custom Trachten bodice manufacturing, OEM production, private-label development, bulk orders, custom embroidery, and wholesale apparel requirements.</strong>',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Embroidered Floral Trachten Bodice with Decorative Front Clo','\\n \\n \\nSpecification