M</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom colors</li>\r\\n 	<li>Floral prints or embroidery</li>\r\\n 	<li>Decorative center panels</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom piping and trims</li>\r\\n 	<li>Clasp and button styles</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom lining and interlining</li>\r\\n 	<li>Size grading</li>\r\\n 	<li>Pattern development</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom labels and branding</li>\r\\n 	<li>Hangtags and care labels</li>\r\\n 	<li>Custom packaging</li>\r\\n 	<li>Wholesale production quantities</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h3>Suitable for Traditional Fashion Collections</h3>\r\\nThe <strong>Floral Trachten Bodice</strong> can be paired with traditional skirts, dresses, blouses, or coordinated garments to create complete Trachten-inspired outfits. Its floral detailing and fitted construction make it suitable for traditional clothing collections as well as modern interpretations of European folk fashion.\r\\n\r\\nIt is suitable for <strong>Trachten brands, traditional clothing retailers, fashion wholesalers, festival apparel suppliers, cultural eventwear, costume suppliers, hospitality collections, and private-label fashion brands</strong>.\r\\n<h3>Quality-Focused Production</h3>\r\\nProduction can be completed according to approved specifications, including fabric selection, pattern development, cutting, stitching, finishing, pressing, quality inspection, and packaging. Attention can be given to <strong>floral pattern placement, center panel alignment, clasp positioning, seam quality, garment measurements, lining, and overall finishing</strong>.\r\\n\r\\nPre-production samples can be developed so buyers can review the <strong>fabric, fit, colors, floral design, trims, closure details, construction, and finishing quality</strong> before bulk production.\r\\n<h3>Custom Trachten Bodice for Wholesale Buyers</h3>\r\\nWhether you need a floral bodice for an existing Trachten collection or want to develop a completely customized design for your own brand, this <strong>Trachten Bodice</strong> provides a flexible foundati