imple','published',0,'visible','','',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Aikido Uniform',NULL,NULL,'products/aikido-uniform-15648-loPsw6bl.jpg',NULL,'2026-10-13 18:24:13','2026-10-13 18:24:39'),(236,15805,NULL,'Jiu Jitsu Uniform','jiu-jitsu-uniform-15805','simple','published',0,'visible','Gear up for the mats with our <b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"30\">Premium Jiu Jitsu Uniform</b>. Crafted from highly durable, lightweight pearl weave cotton, this Gi is designed to withstand the toughest grips and most intense grappling sessions. Featuring reinforced stitching at all major stress points, heavy-duty pants, and a tailored athletic fit, it offers the perfect balance of comfort, unhindered mobility, and rugged durability for both daily training and competition.','<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Premium Jiu Jitsu Uniform - Ultimate Durability &amp; Grappling Performance</h2>\r\\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">When you step onto the mats, your gear needs to work as hard as you do. Our <b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"76\">Premium Jiu Jitsu Uniform</b> is meticulously engineered to meet the rigorous physical demands of Brazilian Jiu Jitsu, offering martial artists a superior blend of strength, comfort, and maneuverability. Whether you are a dedicated white belt mastering the fundamentals or a seasoned competitor preparing for a tournament, this Gi provides the reliable performance you need to roll with absolute confidence.</p>\r\\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">Constructed from top-tier, breathable cotton, the jacket features a specialized pearl weave that is incredibly tough yet light enough to keep you cool during grueling rounds. The accompanying pants are made from a heavy-duty, tear-resistant fabric, designed to withstand heavy friction while allowing for explosive sweeps and flexible guard retention. Featuring a clean, minimalist aesthetic, this uniform leaves ample room for your academy and sponsor patches.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Key Features &amp; Benefits:</h3>\r\\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\r\\n 	<li>\r\\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ultra-Durable Pearl Weave:</b> The jacket is crafted from high-quality woven cotton that aggressively resists stretching, tearing, and heavy collar grips.</p>\r\\n</li>\r\\n 	<li>\r\\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Reinforced Stress Points:</b> Triple-stitched seams, reinforced knees, and heavy-duty gussets in the pants ensure maximum longevity and structural integrity during intense grappling.</p>\r\\n</li>\r\\n 	<li>\r\\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Lightweight &amp; Breathable:</b> Engineered to disperse body heat efficiently, keeping you comfortable and focused without sacrificing toughness.</p>\r\\n</li>\r\\n 	<li>\r\\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Stiffened EVA Lapel:</b> The heat-resistant, rubberized foam collar is exceptionally difficult for opponents to grip and prevents sweat absorption, keeping the Gi hygienic and fresh.</p>\r\\n</li>\r\\n 	<li>\r\\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Athletic Tapered Fit:</b> Thoughtfully tailored to reduce excess, baggy fabric—making it harder for opponents to grab—while still allowing you a complete, natural range of motion.</p>\r\\n</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\">Built for the Grind</h3>\r\\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">Designed to endure daily mat time, this uniform transitions seamlessly from rigorous drilling to high-stakes sparring. It is an essential, foundational piece of equipment built for the modern grappler who demands excellence in every roll.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\">Technical Specifications:</h3>\r\\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\r\\n 	<li>\r\\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material (Jacket):</b> 100% Cotton Premium Pearl Weave</p>\r\\n</li>\r\\n 	<li>\r\\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material (Pants):</b> High-tensile Ripstop or heavy-duty cotton drill with reinforced knees</p>\r\\n</li>\r\\n 	<li>\r\\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Collar:</b> EVA foam core lapel (Fast-drying and anti-microbial)</p>\r\\n</li>\r\\n 	<li>\r\\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fit:</b> Traditional BJJ tapered fit (Check size chart for A0-A4 sizing)</p>\r\\n</li>\r\\n 	<li>\r\\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Care Instructions:</b> Machine wash cold, hang dry strictly recommended to prevent shrinking; do not use bleach or tumble dry.</p>\r\\n</li>\r\\n</ul>',0.00,NULL,0.00,50,NULL,NULL,25,1,75.00,1,NULL,NULL,1,0,'instock',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Jiu Jitsu Uniform','Gear up for the mats with our Premium Jiu Jitsu Uniform. Crafted from highly durable, lightweight pearl weave cotton, this Gi is designed to withstand the tough',NULL,'products/jiu-jitsu-uniform-15805-uV1mCOkk.jpg',NULL,'2026-10-13 18:24:13','2026-10-13 18:24:40'),(237,15847,NULL,'Jiu Jitsu Uniform','jiu-jitsu-uniform-15847','simple','published',0,'visible','','<div class=\"J_module\">\r\\n<div class=\"detail-decorate-json-renderer-container\">\r\\n<div class=\"magic-4\">\r\\n<div class=\"magic-5\">\r\\n<div class=\"magic-6\">\r\\n<div class=\"magic-7\" data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2700.details-description.0.i0.457dHmYfHmYf8D\"><span class=\"magic-8\">&gt;Wholesale High Quality Manufacture <b>Jui Jitsu Uniform</b></span>\r\\n<div><span class=\"magic-8\">&gt;Any Color available according to customer\'s demand</span>\r\\n<div><span class=\"magic-8\">&gt;All Sizes Are Avail